<body region="r1">
<div>
<p begin="00:00:00.200" end="00:00:04.000" style="s2">The hockey star I&#39;ve had a crush on for</p>
<p begin="00:00:01.500" end="00:00:04.000" style="s2">four years.</p>
<p begin="00:00:05.200" end="00:00:10.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh god.</p>
<p begin="00:00:07.600" end="00:00:13.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My hockey idol, cool, hot as hell.</p>
<p begin="00:00:10.600" end="00:00:14.700" style="s2">Always so proper, always holding back.</p>
<p begin="00:00:13.200" end="00:00:16.500" style="s2">But he&#39;ll never know I picture him as my</p>
<p begin="00:00:14.700" end="00:00:19.100" style="s2">partner when I rehearse those dances</p>
<p begin="00:00:16.500" end="00:00:19.100" style="s2">late at night.</p>
<p begin="00:00:19.600" end="00:00:22.700" style="s2">Let&#39;s see what you guys sent me.</p>
<p begin="00:00:30.785" end="00:00:34.400" style="s2">[cough]</p>
<p begin="00:00:32.500" end="00:00:35.900" style="s2">Oh god. I sent him my late night dance</p>
<p begin="00:00:34.400" end="00:00:37.900" style="s2">rehearsal instead of my fan video, and</p>
<p begin="00:00:35.900" end="00:00:41.000" style="s2">he&#39;s playing it for everyone. Please let</p>
<p begin="00:00:37.900" end="00:00:41.000" style="s2">me disappear.</p>
<p begin="00:00:43.500" end="00:00:49.100" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Easy, Noah. Keep it casual. Keep your</p>
<p begin="00:00:46.100" end="00:00:49.100" style="s2">hands to yourself.</p>
<p begin="00:00:49.600" end="00:00:52.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He can&#39;t find out I&#39;m the idiot who</p>
<p begin="00:00:51.300" end="00:00:55.400" style="s2">spent his nights dancing for a dummy in</p>
<p begin="00:00:52.800" end="00:00:56.400" style="s2">his jersey.</p>
<p begin="00:00:55.400" end="00:00:58.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you having second thoughts about</p>
<p begin="00:00:56.400" end="00:00:59.600" style="s2">this casual hookup? No, a casual hookup</p>
<p begin="00:00:58.200" end="00:01:01.000" style="s2">doesn&#39;t bother me. We met four years</p>
<p begin="00:00:59.600" end="00:01:02.400" style="s2">ago, but you&#39;re still that hockey star I</p>
<p begin="00:01:01.000" end="00:01:03.535" style="s2">look up to. Sleeping with you feels like</p>
<p begin="00:01:02.400" end="00:01:04.000" style="s2">crossing a line.</p>
<p begin="00:01:03.535" end="00:01:05.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:01:04.000" end="00:01:06.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That only makes me want to cross it</p>
<p begin="00:01:05.600" end="00:01:07.800" style="s2">more.</p>
<p begin="00:01:06.600" end="00:01:09.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then let&#39;s get to know each other</p>
<p begin="00:01:07.800" end="00:01:11.100" style="s2">without an audience. Stay and have a</p>
<p begin="00:01:09.400" end="00:01:13.500" style="s2">drink with me. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:01:11.100" end="00:01:16.000" style="s2">There&#39;s no rush to go upstairs.</p>
<p begin="00:01:13.500" end="00:01:17.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I still train every day. Same routine as</p>
<p begin="00:01:16.000" end="00:01:21.700" style="s2">before I retired.</p>
<p begin="00:01:17.800" end="00:01:21.700" style="s2">So stamina won&#39;t be a problem.</p>
<p begin="00:01:22.000" end="00:01:25.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I like things simple. No crowd, no</p>
<p begin="00:01:23.900" end="00:01:26.800" style="s2">distractions, just the two of us. I&#39;d</p>
<p begin="00:01:25.800" end="00:01:27.600" style="s2">like [music] to finish this drink and</p>
<p begin="00:01:26.800" end="00:01:29.300" style="s2">actually get to know</p>
<p begin="00:01:27.600" end="00:01:30.700" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wait, I thought telling him I look up to</p>
<p begin="00:01:29.300" end="00:01:31.800" style="s2">him would make him back off. He&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:01:30.700" end="00:01:33.200" style="s2">sitting there looking that good and</p>
<p begin="00:01:31.800" end="00:01:34.200" style="s2">treating this like a date. What happened</p>
<p begin="00:01:33.200" end="00:01:35.800" style="s2">to a casual hookup?</p>
<p begin="00:01:34.200" end="00:01:38.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And there&#39;s no boyfriend.</p>
<p begin="00:01:35.800" end="00:01:39.400" style="s2">No one else I&#39;m seeing.</p>
<p begin="00:01:38.400" end="00:01:41.500" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay.</p>
<p begin="00:01:39.400" end="00:01:42.900" style="s2">If we&#39;re getting to know each other,</p>
<p begin="00:01:41.500" end="00:01:45.500" style="s2">are you actually that built or is it</p>
<p begin="00:01:42.900" end="00:01:45.500" style="s2">just the shirt?</p>
<p begin="00:01:46.766" end="00:01:48.786" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:01:49.200" end="00:01:52.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Easy, Noah. You&#39;re trying to put him</p>
<p begin="00:01:50.700" end="00:01:54.900" style="s2">off. Don&#39;t let him see how badly you</p>
<p begin="00:01:52.400" end="00:01:57.800" style="s2">want him.</p>
<p begin="00:01:54.900" end="00:01:57.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He really is.</p>
<p begin="00:02:00.800" end="00:02:04.792" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Can I see? I&#39;d check for myself.</p>
<p begin="00:02:05.106" end="00:02:06.692" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:02:05.292" end="00:02:09.492" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sure.</p>
<p begin="00:02:06.692" end="00:02:11.392" style="s2">But the private show is for a boyfriend.</p>
<p begin="00:02:09.492" end="00:02:14.792" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He actually saves that for a boyfriend?</p>
<p begin="00:02:11.392" end="00:02:14.792" style="s2">Great. Now I want him more.</p>
<p begin="00:02:15.692" end="00:02:18.892" style="s2">Anything else you want to know about me?</p>
<p begin="00:02:17.692" end="00:02:21.292" style="s2">Or should we start with what you like in</p>
<p begin="00:02:18.892" end="00:02:21.292" style="s2">a guy?</p>
<p begin="00:02:21.492" end="00:02:26.066" style="s2">My type? I don&#39;t know. Not older guys.</p>
<p begin="00:02:24.292" end="00:02:27.392" style="s2">We never want the same things.</p>
<p begin="00:02:26.066" end="00:02:29.092" style="s2">[music] And I don&#39;t trust men who dress</p>
<p begin="00:02:27.392" end="00:02:31.492" style="s2">that neatly. Too good at looking</p>
<p begin="00:02:29.092" end="00:02:31.492" style="s2">innocent.</p>
<p begin="00:02:31.792" end="00:02:36.392" style="s2">And whiskey? My dad drinks that. Not</p>
<p begin="00:02:33.492" end="00:02:36.392" style="s2">exactly sexy.</p>
<p begin="00:02:37.592" end="00:02:42.292" style="s2">Oh god, every word of that hurts. Truth</p>
<p begin="00:02:40.192" end="00:02:43.192" style="s2">is, that respectable face makes me want</p>
<p begin="00:02:42.292" end="00:02:45.392" style="s2">him even more.</p>
<p begin="00:02:43.192" end="00:02:47.692" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So you don&#39;t want this casual hookup. At</p>
<p begin="00:02:45.392" end="00:02:49.292" style="s2">least not with me.</p>
<p begin="00:02:47.692" end="00:02:50.992" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Damon, it&#39;s about chemistry. You&#39;re a</p>
<p begin="00:02:49.292" end="00:02:52.592" style="s2">great guy. You&#39;ll find someone who&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:02:50.992" end="00:02:54.992" style="s2">right for you. I won&#39;t keep you here any</p>
<p begin="00:02:52.592" end="00:02:54.992" style="s2">longer.</p>
<p begin="00:02:56.492" end="00:03:01.392" style="s2">I need to get home and rehearse. Dancing</p>
<p begin="00:02:58.492" end="00:03:01.392" style="s2">it out will calm me down.</p>
<p begin="00:03:05.892" end="00:03:08.192" style="s2">Sorry.</p>
<p begin="00:03:09.192" end="00:03:14.192" style="s2">Was there something else, Damon?</p>
<p begin="00:03:11.492" end="00:03:14.192" style="s2">Can I have your number?</p>
<p begin="00:03:14.292" end="00:03:16.892" style="s2">We have the app. Do we really need each</p>
<p begin="00:03:15.392" end="00:03:18.792" style="s2">other&#39;s numbers? I&#39;d like to see you</p>
<p begin="00:03:16.892" end="00:03:19.792" style="s2">again. Oh, you mean hockey. Keeping in</p>
<p begin="00:03:18.792" end="00:03:21.892" style="s2">touch with someone you met at the rink.</p>
<p begin="00:03:19.792" end="00:03:24.292" style="s2">That makes sense. Okay, I&#39;ll put my</p>
<p begin="00:03:21.892" end="00:03:24.292" style="s2">number in.</p>
<p begin="00:03:29.992" end="00:03:33.092" style="s2">All right. Give me that.</p>
<p begin="00:03:37.892" end="00:03:41.092" style="s2">Thank you for your cooperation.</p>
<p begin="00:03:39.292" end="00:03:43.492" style="s2">&gt;&gt; When your hockey idol asks, you say yes.</p>
<p begin="00:03:41.092" end="00:03:43.492" style="s2">There&#39;s my number.</p>
<p begin="00:03:44.012" end="00:03:47.292" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:03:45.092" end="00:03:48.692" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;ve talked and I have your number now.</p>
<p begin="00:03:47.292" end="00:03:51.292" style="s2">When can I take you to meet my family as</p>
<p begin="00:03:48.692" end="00:03:51.292" style="s2">my boyfriend?</p>
<p begin="00:03:51.392" end="00:03:54.892" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your boyfriend? We met for a casual</p>
<p begin="00:03:53.192" end="00:03:56.692" style="s2">hookup. Is this a line you use on every</p>
<p begin="00:03:54.892" end="00:03:58.792" style="s2">guy? Damon, shouldn&#39;t we get to know</p>
<p begin="00:03:56.692" end="00:04:01.292" style="s2">each other first? You&#39;re moving a little</p>
<p begin="00:03:58.792" end="00:04:01.292" style="s2">fast.</p>
<p begin="00:04:01.492" end="00:04:05.194" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We already know each other.</p>
<p begin="00:04:03.194" end="00:04:07.494" style="s2">We&#39;ve talked about ourselves.</p>
<p begin="00:04:05.194" end="00:04:10.394" style="s2">You like my body.</p>
<p begin="00:04:07.494" end="00:04:10.394" style="s2">What are we waiting for?</p>
<p begin="00:04:11.594" end="00:04:15.694" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I think we both need a minute. I left a</p>
<p begin="00:04:13.394" end="00:04:18.294" style="s2">load in the washer. I need to get home.</p>
<p begin="00:04:15.694" end="00:04:18.294" style="s2">I&#39;m heading out.</p>
<p begin="00:04:31.694" end="00:04:34.894" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This guy you met for a casual hookup,</p>
<p begin="00:04:33.594" end="00:04:36.194" style="s2">wasn&#39;t he the one in that private dance</p>
<p begin="00:04:34.894" end="00:04:38.394" style="s2">video you played at your fan meet and</p>
<p begin="00:04:36.194" end="00:04:39.894" style="s2">greet four years ago?</p>
<p begin="00:04:38.394" end="00:04:41.494" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good you&#39;re here. Show me how to send my</p>
<p begin="00:04:39.894" end="00:04:43.094" style="s2">contact details.</p>
<p begin="00:04:41.494" end="00:04:44.794" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A smartphone and you&#39;re still collecting</p>
<p begin="00:04:43.094" end="00:04:47.194" style="s2">numbers on paper? Welcome to this</p>
<p begin="00:04:44.794" end="00:04:47.194" style="s2">century.</p>
<p begin="00:04:47.294" end="00:04:49.894" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Add him for me.</p>
<p begin="00:04:51.294" end="00:04:54.094" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Noah Morgan.</p>
<p begin="00:04:55.094" end="00:05:00.994" style="s2">Done. Four years later he falls right</p>
<p begin="00:04:57.294" end="00:05:00.994" style="s2">into your lap. How you getting even?</p>
<p begin="00:05:04.194" end="00:05:07.794" style="s2">Don&#39;t tell me you&#39;re planning to lock</p>
<p begin="00:05:05.194" end="00:05:07.794" style="s2">him up somewhere.</p>
<p begin="00:05:09.094" end="00:05:12.394" style="s2">Sure he dragged your jersey into his</p>
<p begin="00:05:10.394" end="00:05:14.494" style="s2">private show. You can&#39;t kidnap him for</p>
<p begin="00:05:12.394" end="00:05:14.494" style="s2">it.</p>
<p begin="00:05:15.058" end="00:05:16.694" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:05:15.494" end="00:05:17.994" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m talking about introducing him to my</p>
<p begin="00:05:16.694" end="00:05:21.894" style="s2">family as my boyfriend.</p>
<p begin="00:05:17.994" end="00:05:21.894" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Boyfriends already?</p>
<p begin="00:05:22.694" end="00:05:26.294" style="s2">His boyfriend, the guy every hockey fan</p>
<p begin="00:05:24.694" end="00:05:29.194" style="s2">wants? I get to see what&#39;s under that</p>
<p begin="00:05:26.294" end="00:05:29.194" style="s2">shirt every day.</p>
<p begin="00:05:30.394" end="00:05:34.094" style="s2">Wake up Noah. He&#39;s a hockey legend.</p>
<p begin="00:05:32.794" end="00:05:35.094" style="s2">You haven&#39;t even made the team and</p>
<p begin="00:05:34.094" end="00:05:36.594" style="s2">everyone thinks you&#39;re only there</p>
<p begin="00:05:35.094" end="00:05:37.794" style="s2">because of dad.</p>
<p begin="00:05:36.594" end="00:05:38.894" style="s2">Why would he want the screw up who</p>
<p begin="00:05:37.794" end="00:05:41.394" style="s2">embarrassed him and can&#39;t stop</p>
<p begin="00:05:38.894" end="00:05:42.794" style="s2">fantasizing about him? Even if we dated,</p>
<p begin="00:05:41.394" end="00:05:44.994" style="s2">he&#39;d find out dancing is the only thing</p>
<p begin="00:05:42.794" end="00:05:46.294" style="s2">I&#39;m good at. He&#39;d get tired of me.</p>
<p begin="00:05:44.994" end="00:05:47.894" style="s2">Then I couldn&#39;t even admire him from a</p>
<p begin="00:05:46.294" end="00:05:49.194" style="s2">distance.</p>
<p begin="00:05:47.894" end="00:05:50.494" style="s2">Better not to start than to have him and</p>
<p begin="00:05:49.194" end="00:05:51.594" style="s2">lose him.</p>
<p begin="00:05:50.494" end="00:05:53.594" style="s2">Remember his face when he played that</p>
<p begin="00:05:51.594" end="00:05:55.294" style="s2">video? A man that rigid doesn&#39;t suddenly</p>
<p begin="00:05:53.594" end="00:05:57.094" style="s2">change. I need to play it cool. He</p>
<p begin="00:05:55.294" end="00:05:59.394" style="s2">cannot know I&#39;m interested, not even a</p>
<p begin="00:05:57.094" end="00:05:59.394" style="s2">little.</p>
<p begin="00:06:02.219" end="00:06:04.239" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:06:06.594" end="00:06:10.134" style="s2">That old school actually asked me to</p>
<p begin="00:06:07.895" end="00:06:10.134" style="s2">dinner. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:06:11.295" end="00:06:14.295" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wait.</p>
<p begin="00:06:12.095" end="00:06:16.495" style="s2">Dinner there costs a fortune. He&#39;ll look</p>
<p begin="00:06:14.295" end="00:06:18.295" style="s2">right at home. I&#39;ll be in cheap training</p>
<p begin="00:06:16.495" end="00:06:20.295" style="s2">clothes, not knowing what to do with my</p>
<p begin="00:06:18.295" end="00:06:22.895" style="s2">hands. Is he trying to make me look</p>
<p begin="00:06:20.295" end="00:06:22.895" style="s2">ridiculous?</p>
<p begin="00:06:27.109" end="00:06:29.129" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:06:38.595" end="00:06:42.495" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He doesn&#39;t look like a guy who eats</p>
<p begin="00:06:39.695" end="00:06:44.095" style="s2">elbow to elbow with strangers.</p>
<p begin="00:06:42.495" end="00:06:46.895" style="s2">Let&#39;s see if he&#39;s still so untouchable</p>
<p begin="00:06:44.095" end="00:06:47.995" style="s2">at a sticky little burger table.</p>
<p begin="00:06:46.895" end="00:06:49.395" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Cancel the dinner you booked at the</p>
<p begin="00:06:47.995" end="00:06:50.695" style="s2">Raven. Plans changed.</p>
<p begin="00:06:49.395" end="00:06:52.295" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What happened? The guy with the dance</p>
<p begin="00:06:50.695" end="00:06:53.395" style="s2">video finally knocked our unshakable</p>
<p begin="00:06:52.295" end="00:06:55.695" style="s2">captain off balance?</p>
<p begin="00:06:53.395" end="00:06:58.595" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No. He changed the game plan.</p>
<p begin="00:06:55.695" end="00:06:58.595" style="s2">I&#39;m going to see how he plays it.</p>
<p begin="00:07:02.195" end="00:07:07.395" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Could you talk like a person? No guy</p>
<p begin="00:07:04.095" end="00:07:07.395" style="s2">wants a team briefing on a date.</p>
<p begin="00:07:07.695" end="00:07:10.695" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is the food there any good?</p>
<p begin="00:07:13.795" end="00:07:18.095" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No frown, no disgust. This isn&#39;t going</p>
<p begin="00:07:16.295" end="00:07:20.795" style="s2">how I planned.</p>
<p begin="00:07:18.095" end="00:07:20.795" style="s2">There it is.</p>
<p begin="00:07:21.595" end="00:07:24.495" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That door handle&#39;s greasy here. Clean</p>
<p begin="00:07:23.095" end="00:07:26.795" style="s2">your hands.</p>
<p begin="00:07:24.495" end="00:07:26.795" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thanks.</p>
<p begin="00:07:27.495" end="00:07:33.395" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dirt leg, a folded clipper</p>
<p begin="00:07:30.095" end="00:07:33.395" style="s2">will keep your drink off your lap.</p>
<p begin="00:07:34.895" end="00:07:38.395" style="s2">You&#39;re pretty good at this.</p>
<p begin="00:07:36.995" end="00:07:39.295" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Excuse me.</p>
<p begin="00:07:38.395" end="00:07:41.395" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hi.</p>
<p begin="00:07:39.295" end="00:07:44.295" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thanks.</p>
<p begin="00:07:41.395" end="00:07:46.195" style="s2">&gt;&gt; One cheeseburger, plain, no sauce.</p>
<p begin="00:07:44.295" end="00:07:48.195" style="s2">Keep the patty juicy.</p>
<p begin="00:07:46.195" end="00:07:48.595" style="s2">And the loaded fries, no raw onion on</p>
<p begin="00:07:48.195" end="00:07:50.795" style="s2">top.</p>
<p begin="00:07:48.595" end="00:07:50.795" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sure.</p>
<p begin="00:07:51.495" end="00:07:54.395" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No raw onion for you either? You hate</p>
<p begin="00:07:53.095" end="00:07:57.995" style="s2">that weird taste, too?</p>
<p begin="00:07:54.395" end="00:07:57.995" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Like chewing on a sweaty gym sock.</p>
<p begin="00:07:58.495" end="00:08:04.095" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Exactly. A sweaty jam sock.</p>
<p begin="00:08:01.895" end="00:08:06.395" style="s2">How do we even have the same weird</p>
<p begin="00:08:04.095" end="00:08:06.395" style="s2">thought?</p>
<p begin="00:08:11.097" end="00:08:13.697" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why would anyone put this in a perfectly</p>
<p begin="00:08:12.297" end="00:08:14.997" style="s2">good burger?</p>
<p begin="00:08:13.697" end="00:08:16.297" style="s2">Raw onion?</p>
<p begin="00:08:14.997" end="00:08:19.497" style="s2">One bite and it&#39;s like chewing on a</p>
<p begin="00:08:16.297" end="00:08:19.497" style="s2">sweaty gym sock.</p>
<p begin="00:08:27.297" end="00:08:30.897" style="s2">Coach, you&#39;re good at ordering.</p>
<p begin="00:08:29.497" end="00:08:33.297" style="s2">Everything you picked is something I</p>
<p begin="00:08:30.897" end="00:08:33.297" style="s2">love.</p>
<p begin="00:08:34.197" end="00:08:40.597" style="s2">Same taste, same reactions. Looks like</p>
<p begin="00:08:36.997" end="00:08:40.597" style="s2">our bodies agree on quite a lot.</p>
<p begin="00:08:43.397" end="00:08:47.397" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He thinks raw onion tastes like a sweaty</p>
<p begin="00:08:45.397" end="00:08:50.797" style="s2">sock, too? You two are made for each</p>
<p begin="00:08:47.397" end="00:08:52.897" style="s2">other. This relationship</p>
<p begin="00:08:50.797" end="00:08:56.097" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Doesn&#39;t that scare you? He&#39;s a hockey</p>
<p begin="00:08:52.897" end="00:08:58.097" style="s2">legend, completely out of my league.</p>
<p begin="00:08:56.097" end="00:08:59.897" style="s2">I dance behind a mask and fantasize</p>
<p begin="00:08:58.097" end="00:09:02.397" style="s2">about him. How does that make us a</p>
<p begin="00:08:59.897" end="00:09:02.397" style="s2">match?</p>
<p begin="00:09:02.697" end="00:09:06.897" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s not finding fault with you. Why are</p>
<p begin="00:09:03.997" end="00:09:06.897" style="s2">you doing it for him?</p>
<p begin="00:09:08.897" end="00:09:11.597" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t know.</p>
<p begin="00:09:10.097" end="00:09:13.797" style="s2">The harder he tries, the more it feels</p>
<p begin="00:09:11.597" end="00:09:15.697" style="s2">like a trap. I humiliated him with that</p>
<p begin="00:09:13.797" end="00:09:17.097" style="s2">video. Maybe he&#39;s being nice now so he</p>
<p begin="00:09:15.697" end="00:09:19.897" style="s2">can get me back later.</p>
<p begin="00:09:17.097" end="00:09:21.397" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s your guilty conscience talking.</p>
<p begin="00:09:19.897" end="00:09:23.397" style="s2">You&#39;ve got his number now. Open his</p>
<p begin="00:09:21.397" end="00:09:26.097" style="s2">profile. [music] Let me see. Let me</p>
<p begin="00:09:23.397" end="00:09:26.097" style="s2">figure him out.</p>
<p begin="00:09:30.497" end="00:09:34.197" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Just one photo.</p>
<p begin="00:09:31.897" end="00:09:36.197" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A parking lot, very romantic [music] and</p>
<p begin="00:09:34.197" end="00:09:37.797" style="s2">barely in focus.</p>
<p begin="00:09:36.197" end="00:09:40.097" style="s2">Wait, isn&#39;t that outside the rink where</p>
<p begin="00:09:37.797" end="00:09:42.397" style="s2">you played in college?</p>
<p begin="00:09:40.097" end="00:09:44.897" style="s2">That guy in the corner, backward cap,</p>
<p begin="00:09:42.397" end="00:09:47.397" style="s2">shirt inside out, those shoulders,</p>
<p begin="00:09:44.897" end="00:09:47.397" style="s2">that&#39;s you.</p>
<p begin="00:09:53.197" end="00:09:56.497" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That actually does look like me.</p>
<p begin="00:09:57.297" end="00:10:01.097" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why would he use a photo of you from</p>
<p begin="00:09:58.997" end="00:10:04.797" style="s2">four years ago? [music]</p>
<p begin="00:10:01.097" end="00:10:07.097" style="s2">Has he had a crush on you all this time?</p>
<p begin="00:10:04.797" end="00:10:08.297" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No way. I was nobody at that rink. He</p>
<p begin="00:10:07.097" end="00:10:12.198" style="s2">looked through me like I was part of the</p>
<p begin="00:10:08.297" end="00:10:15.098" style="s2">boards. Why would he have a crush on me?</p>
<p begin="00:10:12.198" end="00:10:16.362" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Get him alone. Get a little closer. See</p>
<p begin="00:10:15.098" end="00:10:18.382" style="s2">how he reacts.</p>
<p begin="00:10:16.362" end="00:10:18.382" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:10:20.198" end="00:10:24.998" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Coach, if you want to be my boyfriend, I</p>
<p begin="00:10:22.698" end="00:10:28.798" style="s2">should test your stamina first. Tomorrow</p>
<p begin="00:10:24.998" end="00:10:28.798" style="s2">at 2:00. Think you can handle it?</p>
<p begin="00:10:28.807" end="00:10:31.898" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:10:29.798" end="00:10:34.398" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 2:00 in the afternoon.</p>
<p begin="00:10:31.898" end="00:10:34.398" style="s2">Bold.</p>
<p begin="00:10:36.098" end="00:10:38.498" style="s2">Deal.</p>
<p begin="00:10:41.598" end="00:10:44.998" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is your stamina test.</p>
<p begin="00:10:43.298" end="00:10:47.798" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You said you like working out. I figured</p>
<p begin="00:10:44.998" end="00:10:47.798" style="s2">we could try it together.</p>
<p begin="00:10:49.112" end="00:10:53.198" style="s2">[panting]</p>
<p begin="00:10:50.998" end="00:10:55.498" style="s2">Seated rows, 60 lbs to start. Can you do</p>
<p begin="00:10:53.198" end="00:10:55.498" style="s2">that?</p>
<p begin="00:10:58.298" end="00:11:01.298" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A back like that should be on every</p>
<p begin="00:10:59.898" end="00:11:02.998" style="s2">underwear ad.</p>
<p begin="00:11:01.298" end="00:11:04.177" style="s2">You came here to find out if he likes</p>
<p begin="00:11:02.998" end="00:11:05.498" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="00:11:04.177" end="00:11:07.498" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [clears throat]</p>
<p begin="00:11:05.498" end="00:11:08.598" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Too light, coach? Add some more.</p>
<p begin="00:11:07.498" end="00:11:09.798" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t hold back just because I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:11:08.598" end="00:11:12.098" style="s2">watching.</p>
<p begin="00:11:09.798" end="00:11:14.698" style="s2">Not enough for you? You pick the weight.</p>
<p begin="00:11:12.098" end="00:11:14.698" style="s2">I&#39;ll lift it.</p>
<p begin="00:11:19.098" end="00:11:22.598" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ve got it.</p>
<p begin="00:11:21.298" end="00:11:25.098" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He caught me with that weight still in</p>
<p begin="00:11:22.598" end="00:11:25.098" style="s2">his hand?</p>
<p begin="00:11:25.298" end="00:11:29.298" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 80 enough?</p>
<p begin="00:11:26.598" end="00:11:30.498" style="s2">Want another plate?</p>
<p begin="00:11:29.298" end="00:11:32.998" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Forget it. Race me at the rink. This is</p>
<p begin="00:11:30.498" end="00:11:32.998" style="s2">getting boring.</p>
<p begin="00:11:39.898" end="00:11:42.798" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Coach, speed is my thing. You&#39;re not</p>
<p begin="00:11:41.998" end="00:11:44.298" style="s2">beating me at this.</p>
<p begin="00:11:42.798" end="00:11:46.698" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is that right?</p>
<p begin="00:11:44.298" end="00:11:46.698" style="s2">Show me.</p>
<p begin="00:11:56.198" end="00:11:59.098" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I won.</p>
<p begin="00:11:57.598" end="00:12:00.098" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Those turns were sharp.</p>
<p begin="00:11:59.098" end="00:12:00.998" style="s2">You picked your line well.</p>
<p begin="00:12:00.098" end="00:12:02.798" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m impressed.</p>
<p begin="00:12:00.998" end="00:12:05.098" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Did you let me win? I saw you ease up.</p>
<p begin="00:12:02.798" end="00:12:06.998" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I did. I saw the openings to pass you.</p>
<p begin="00:12:05.098" end="00:12:10.198" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Again, no letting me win this time. No</p>
<p begin="00:12:06.998" end="00:12:13.299" style="s2">holding back. Best man wins.</p>
<p begin="00:12:10.198" end="00:12:13.299" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then I won&#39;t hold back.</p>
<p begin="00:12:16.399" end="00:12:21.999" style="s2">That cramp again? Seriously?</p>
<p begin="00:12:18.999" end="00:12:23.799" style="s2">I barely started.</p>
<p begin="00:12:21.999" end="00:12:25.398" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You said no holding back.</p>
<p begin="00:12:23.799" end="00:12:27.418" style="s2">Why did you</p>
<p begin="00:12:25.398" end="00:12:27.418" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:12:28.999" end="00:12:32.199" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What happened? Where does it hurt?</p>
<p begin="00:12:30.299" end="00:12:35.299" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s just a cramp. It usually hits much</p>
<p begin="00:12:32.199" end="00:12:35.299" style="s2">later. I can walk.</p>
<p begin="00:12:37.299" end="00:12:40.899" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 30 seconds and this pack reaches 125°</p>
<p begin="00:12:39.699" end="00:12:43.899" style="s2">Fahrenheit. Hang on. Do you even know</p>
<p begin="00:12:40.899" end="00:12:45.499" style="s2">how hot it gets? Do you get cramps, too?</p>
<p begin="00:12:43.899" end="00:12:48.099" style="s2">Years of hockey, you learn which heat</p>
<p begin="00:12:45.499" end="00:12:48.099" style="s2">packs work.</p>
<p begin="00:12:48.323" end="00:12:51.199" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:12:49.099" end="00:12:52.699" style="s2">It&#39;s warm right over the tight muscle</p>
<p begin="00:12:51.199" end="00:12:56.299" style="s2">with the towel between. Want to do it</p>
<p begin="00:12:52.699" end="00:12:59.199" style="s2">yourself or should I? I&#39;ve got it.</p>
<p begin="00:12:56.299" end="00:12:59.199" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mind if I use your hot plate?</p>
<p begin="00:13:05.999" end="00:13:09.799" style="s2">&gt;&gt; One spoonful of honey, three apple</p>
<p begin="00:13:08.099" end="00:13:11.099" style="s2">slices.</p>
<p begin="00:13:09.799" end="00:13:12.899" style="s2">Mom makes this when cramps leave me</p>
<p begin="00:13:11.099" end="00:13:14.499" style="s2">miserable. How did he get it exactly</p>
<p begin="00:13:12.899" end="00:13:16.199" style="s2">right?</p>
<p begin="00:13:14.499" end="00:13:17.699" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;ve never had a boyfriend, have you?</p>
<p begin="00:13:16.199" end="00:13:19.099" style="s2">How do you know this recipe so well?</p>
<p begin="00:13:17.699" end="00:13:20.299" style="s2">&gt;&gt; When my mother was unwell, I learned to</p>
<p begin="00:13:19.099" end="00:13:21.699" style="s2">cook for her.</p>
<p begin="00:13:20.299" end="00:13:23.499" style="s2">One spoonful of honey, three apple</p>
<p begin="00:13:21.699" end="00:13:23.999" style="s2">slices. She found it easier to eat that</p>
<p begin="00:13:23.499" end="00:13:25.799" style="s2">way.</p>
<p begin="00:13:23.999" end="00:13:27.899" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Get a grip, Noah. He feels sorry for</p>
<p begin="00:13:25.799" end="00:13:31.099" style="s2">you. He&#39;s helping out and you&#39;re already</p>
<p begin="00:13:27.899" end="00:13:33.499" style="s2">telling yourself you&#39;re special to him.</p>
<p begin="00:13:31.099" end="00:13:33.499" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you.</p>
<p begin="00:13:34.899" end="00:13:38.499" style="s2">Careful, it&#39;s hot.</p>
<p begin="00:13:36.999" end="00:13:40.299" style="s2">I make proper meals, too, not just</p>
<p begin="00:13:38.499" end="00:13:42.199" style="s2">oatmeal. Nothing too heavy. Tell me what</p>
<p begin="00:13:40.299" end="00:13:44.299" style="s2">you like and I&#39;ll adjust it.</p>
<p begin="00:13:42.199" end="00:13:45.399" style="s2">When you&#39;re hungry, I&#39;ll cook.</p>
<p begin="00:13:44.299" end="00:13:47.799" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, you don&#39;t have to go to all that</p>
<p begin="00:13:45.399" end="00:13:47.799" style="s2">trouble.</p>
<p begin="00:13:49.699" end="00:13:51.914" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My mother. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:13:52.299" end="00:13:56.299" style="s2">Lock the door. Don&#39;t open it for anyone</p>
<p begin="00:13:53.999" end="00:13:56.299" style="s2">but me.</p>
<p begin="00:13:57.099" end="00:14:00.599" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That sounded so intimate. It probably</p>
<p begin="00:13:58.699" end="00:14:01.699" style="s2">just means basic safety.</p>
<p begin="00:14:00.599" end="00:14:04.599" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Noah,</p>
<p begin="00:14:01.699" end="00:14:06.399" style="s2">you dance behind a mask.</p>
<p begin="00:14:04.599" end="00:14:07.799" style="s2">Stop imagining you&#39;re the love of a</p>
<p begin="00:14:06.399" end="00:14:09.799" style="s2">hockey legend&#39;s life.</p>
<p begin="00:14:07.799" end="00:14:11.499" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Look at these men, successful, single,</p>
<p begin="00:14:09.799" end="00:14:13.599" style="s2">all in Gray Haven. Pick one and meet him</p>
<p begin="00:14:11.499" end="00:14:14.799" style="s2">tomorrow. You&#39;re 36. Do you want to grow</p>
<p begin="00:14:13.599" end="00:14:15.501" style="s2">old alone?</p>
<p begin="00:14:14.799" end="00:14:16.999" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, you can stop</p>
<p begin="00:14:15.501" end="00:14:17.201" style="s2">&gt;&gt; looking. There&#39;s already someone I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:14:16.999" end="00:14:17.901" style="s2">&gt;&gt; &#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:14:17.201" end="00:14:19.701" style="s2">&gt;&gt; to know.</p>
<p begin="00:14:17.901" end="00:14:21.601" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t give me that. All you do is watch</p>
<p begin="00:14:19.701" end="00:14:24.101" style="s2">hockey and talk hockey. Where would you</p>
<p begin="00:14:21.601" end="00:14:24.101" style="s2">find a man?</p>
<p begin="00:14:25.201" end="00:14:27.901" style="s2">He looks so young. Are you messing with</p>
<p begin="00:14:27.201" end="00:14:29.101" style="s2">me?</p>
<p begin="00:14:27.901" end="00:14:31.601" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s 25.</p>
<p begin="00:14:29.101" end="00:14:33.201" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You coach him? Damon, have you no shame?</p>
<p begin="00:14:31.601" end="00:14:35.101" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s an adult, mom, with a life of his</p>
<p begin="00:14:33.201" end="00:14:37.001" style="s2">own. He chooses who he dates. He&#39;s the</p>
<p begin="00:14:35.101" end="00:14:38.401" style="s2">only man I want. I&#39;m not looking for a</p>
<p begin="00:14:37.001" end="00:14:40.901" style="s2">second choice.</p>
<p begin="00:14:38.401" end="00:14:42.601" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dating a player is a mess. [music] Still</p>
<p begin="00:14:40.901" end="00:14:44.101" style="s2">better than growing old with nothing but</p>
<p begin="00:14:42.601" end="00:14:47.501" style="s2">hockey.</p>
<p begin="00:14:44.101" end="00:14:50.001" style="s2">If he&#39;s sure, I&#39;ll accept [music] it.</p>
<p begin="00:14:47.501" end="00:14:50.001" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who is it?</p>
<p begin="00:14:53.401" end="00:14:56.001" style="s2">Coach?</p>
<p begin="00:14:54.601" end="00:14:57.901" style="s2">What are you doing here this early?</p>
<p begin="00:14:56.001" end="00:14:59.301" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dropping off breakfast. [music] I was</p>
<p begin="00:14:57.901" end="00:15:01.201" style="s2">passing by.</p>
<p begin="00:14:59.301" end="00:15:02.701" style="s2">I&#39;m usually up early. The bagels are</p>
<p begin="00:15:01.201" end="00:15:04.701" style="s2">fresh in the morning, so I picked some</p>
<p begin="00:15:02.701" end="00:15:07.701" style="s2">up for you. Can I come in?</p>
<p begin="00:15:04.701" end="00:15:07.701" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You can leave your shoes on.</p>
<p begin="00:15:10.460" end="00:15:14.601" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:15:11.401" end="00:15:14.601" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Careful, it&#39;s hot.</p>
<p begin="00:15:15.401" end="00:15:18.401" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Spinach and egg.</p>
<p begin="00:15:16.801" end="00:15:19.630" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s my favorite bagel there. Turns</p>
<p begin="00:15:18.401" end="00:15:20.901" style="s2">out you&#39;re not just a good coach.</p>
<p begin="00:15:19.630" end="00:15:23.501" style="s2">[music] You&#39;ve got good taste, too.</p>
<p begin="00:15:20.901" end="00:15:23.501" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you. Try it.</p>
<p begin="00:15:24.301" end="00:15:27.501" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This broth looks rich. It must have</p>
<p begin="00:15:25.901" end="00:15:28.901" style="s2">simmered for at least 3 hours. This</p>
<p begin="00:15:27.501" end="00:15:29.701" style="s2">isn&#39;t takeout. Coach, did you just</p>
<p begin="00:15:28.901" end="00:15:31.301" style="s2">happen to make it, too?</p>
<p begin="00:15:29.701" end="00:15:34.201" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Less talking, more eating. Your muscles</p>
<p begin="00:15:31.301" end="00:15:34.201" style="s2">need fuel to recover.</p>
<p begin="00:15:38.501" end="00:15:43.101" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Noah?</p>
<p begin="00:15:40.601" end="00:15:43.101" style="s2">Noah?</p>
<p begin="00:15:46.201" end="00:15:49.201" style="s2">Noah?</p>
<p begin="00:15:47.601" end="00:15:51.401" style="s2">I brought that chicken grandma sent us.</p>
