<p begin="00:22:23.905" end="00:22:25.505" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s bribery.</p>
<p begin="00:22:25.385" end="00:22:26.806" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:22:25.505" end="00:22:29.806" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So, Noah, ready to</p>
<p begin="00:22:26.806" end="00:22:29.806" style="s2">&gt;&gt; this more than one date?</p>
<p begin="00:22:30.606" end="00:22:33.706" style="s2">The team offices are right there.</p>
<p begin="00:22:37.175" end="00:22:42.106" style="s2">[snorts] Stupid. Why can&#39;t I get this</p>
<p begin="00:22:39.706" end="00:22:42.106" style="s2">right?</p>
<p begin="00:22:45.406" end="00:22:49.106" style="s2">Wait. If I&#39;ve already given into that</p>
<p begin="00:22:47.106" end="00:22:51.406" style="s2">body, I might as well put it to use.</p>
<p begin="00:22:49.106" end="00:22:52.506" style="s2">Time to put you to work, coach.</p>
<p begin="00:22:51.406" end="00:22:54.306" style="s2">In my rehearsal, you&#39;re getting a full</p>
<p begin="00:22:52.506" end="00:22:56.506" style="s2">song of punishment. Let see you talk</p>
<p begin="00:22:54.306" end="00:22:57.906" style="s2">tactics through that.</p>
<p begin="00:22:56.506" end="00:22:58.706" style="s2">You dragged me out of bed to put me to</p>
<p begin="00:22:57.906" end="00:23:00.206" style="s2">work?</p>
<p begin="00:22:58.706" end="00:23:01.406" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You asked me to cook for you.</p>
<p begin="00:23:00.206" end="00:23:03.006" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It didn&#39;t have to be this early.</p>
<p begin="00:23:01.406" end="00:23:04.006" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I wanted to ask about the team. Have</p>
<p begin="00:23:03.006" end="00:23:04.506" style="s2">they said when they&#39;ll decide if you&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:23:04.006" end="00:23:05.706" style="s2">staying?</p>
<p begin="00:23:04.506" end="00:23:06.906" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s going well. The coach likes my</p>
<p begin="00:23:05.706" end="00:23:08.306" style="s2">work. Staying should just be a matter of</p>
<p begin="00:23:06.906" end="00:23:09.706" style="s2">finishing the tryouts. Stop worrying.</p>
<p begin="00:23:08.306" end="00:23:12.206" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good. Once your place is secure, I can</p>
<p begin="00:23:09.706" end="00:23:12.206" style="s2">relax.</p>
<p begin="00:23:18.606" end="00:23:22.206" style="s2">Who&#39;s texting you? Someone from the</p>
<p begin="00:23:19.906" end="00:23:22.206" style="s2">team?</p>
<p begin="00:23:29.106" end="00:23:32.706" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That sounds like [music] unpaid labor.</p>
<p begin="00:23:30.806" end="00:23:36.506" style="s2">Where&#39;s this operation? Call me next</p>
<p begin="00:23:32.706" end="00:23:36.506" style="s2">time you get sentenced to kitchen duty.</p>
<p begin="00:23:37.006" end="00:23:40.406" style="s2">I&#39;m trying to win him over. I should</p>
<p begin="00:23:38.706" end="00:23:43.106" style="s2">probably get him a gift.</p>
<p begin="00:23:40.406" end="00:23:43.106" style="s2">What would he like?</p>
<p begin="00:23:47.606" end="00:23:51.206" style="s2">Our legendary captain is studying dating</p>
<p begin="00:23:49.406" end="00:23:53.506" style="s2">guides before breakfast. All this to buy</p>
<p begin="00:23:51.206" end="00:23:55.306" style="s2">the guy a present?</p>
<p begin="00:23:53.506" end="00:23:57.006" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good. I&#39;ve read the advice, but I need</p>
<p begin="00:23:55.306" end="00:23:59.306" style="s2">something that actually works. You&#39;ve</p>
<p begin="00:23:57.006" end="00:24:01.606" style="s2">dated [laughter] more. Give me examples.</p>
<p begin="00:23:59.306" end="00:24:03.706" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Forget the guides. He likes your money,</p>
<p begin="00:24:01.606" end="00:24:04.206" style="s2">your face, or what he imagines doing</p>
<p begin="00:24:03.706" end="00:24:05.706" style="s2">with you.</p>
<p begin="00:24:04.206" end="00:24:07.306" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Undo a couple of buttons. Give him</p>
<p begin="00:24:05.706" end="00:24:09.206" style="s2">something to look at.</p>
<p begin="00:24:07.306" end="00:24:09.806" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not useful.</p>
<p begin="00:24:09.206" end="00:24:11.306" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who is it?</p>
<p begin="00:24:09.806" end="00:24:12.806" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hold on.</p>
<p begin="00:24:11.306" end="00:24:14.606" style="s2">Open the door. [music] It&#39;s me.</p>
<p begin="00:24:12.806" end="00:24:16.306" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh.</p>
<p begin="00:24:14.606" end="00:24:17.506" style="s2">Coach, why are you here so late?</p>
<p begin="00:24:16.306" end="00:24:19.306" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I passed a bookstore and picked up a</p>
<p begin="00:24:17.506" end="00:24:20.806" style="s2">couple of books. You liked illustrated</p>
<p begin="00:24:19.306" end="00:24:22.306" style="s2">sports books in college, didn&#39;t you?</p>
<p begin="00:24:20.806" end="00:24:24.406" style="s2">Read them when you have time.</p>
<p begin="00:24:22.306" end="00:24:25.606" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I do like those. Thank [music] you.</p>
<p begin="00:24:24.406" end="00:24:28.306" style="s2">They&#39;re heavy.</p>
<p begin="00:24:25.606" end="00:24:28.306" style="s2">Let me carry them in.</p>
<p begin="00:24:28.606" end="00:24:32.456" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Come in.</p>
<p begin="00:24:30.607" end="00:24:33.207" style="s2">Shoes are fine.</p>
<p begin="00:24:32.456" end="00:24:35.408" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:24:33.207" end="00:24:36.607" style="s2">God, you smell good.</p>
<p begin="00:24:35.408" end="00:24:39.007" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What was that?</p>
<p begin="00:24:36.607" end="00:24:40.507" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, stop being so thirsty.</p>
<p begin="00:24:39.007" end="00:24:42.007" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nothing. Forget it.</p>
<p begin="00:24:40.507" end="00:24:44.007" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A smell can stay with you longer than</p>
<p begin="00:24:42.007" end="00:24:44.908" style="s2">almost anything else.</p>
<p begin="00:24:44.007" end="00:24:46.408" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And?</p>
<p begin="00:24:44.908" end="00:24:49.107" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So take your time. Make sure you</p>
<p begin="00:24:46.408" end="00:24:49.107" style="s2">remember mine.</p>
<p begin="00:24:49.408" end="00:24:52.607" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I start traveling for work tomorrow, on</p>
<p begin="00:24:51.207" end="00:24:54.707" style="s2">and off for about a month.</p>
<p begin="00:24:52.607" end="00:24:56.207" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where? Up the coast. [music] We need to</p>
<p begin="00:24:54.707" end="00:24:57.408" style="s2">watch players before their contracts run</p>
<p begin="00:24:56.207" end="00:24:59.107" style="s2">out. I&#39;ve heard about those clubs.</p>
<p begin="00:24:57.408" end="00:25:00.307" style="s2">There&#39;s a lot of good hockey up there.</p>
<p begin="00:24:59.107" end="00:25:01.307" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I may be out of reach during the day</p>
<p begin="00:25:00.307" end="00:25:02.307" style="s2">inside the rinks.</p>
<p begin="00:25:01.307" end="00:25:03.307" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s fine. I&#39;m busy during the day,</p>
<p begin="00:25:02.307" end="00:25:05.807" style="s2">too. Do what you need to do.</p>
<p begin="00:25:03.307" end="00:25:08.007" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then we&#39;ll talk at [music] night.</p>
<p begin="00:25:05.807" end="00:25:08.007" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay.</p>
<p begin="00:25:08.707" end="00:25:11.107" style="s2">Remember to read them.</p>
<p begin="00:25:09.707" end="00:25:11.757" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I will.</p>
<p begin="00:25:11.107" end="00:25:11.807" style="s2">I should go.</p>
<p begin="00:25:11.757" end="00:25:15.107" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:25:11.807" end="00:25:15.107" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay. Drive safe.</p>
<p begin="00:25:15.908" end="00:25:18.707" style="s2">Remember to lock the [music] door.</p>
<p begin="00:25:21.507" end="00:25:25.408" style="s2">Oh god. Did he take a class in looking</p>
<p begin="00:25:23.507" end="00:25:27.107" style="s2">respectable while driving men insane?</p>
<p begin="00:25:25.408" end="00:25:29.007" style="s2">How am I supposed to survive that?</p>
<p begin="00:25:27.107" end="00:25:33.307" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course. Even his gifts come with</p>
<p begin="00:25:29.007" end="00:25:33.307" style="s2">homework, the history of hockey jerseys.</p>
<p begin="00:25:34.107" end="00:25:38.908" style="s2">The athlete in motion. Damon Cole, you</p>
<p begin="00:25:36.408" end="00:25:38.908" style="s2">dirty man.</p>
<p begin="00:25:43.607" end="00:25:46.607" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You wanted to see me, Victoria?</p>
<p begin="00:25:44.807" end="00:25:47.408" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Noah, how are you getting along with</p>
<p begin="00:25:46.607" end="00:25:48.307" style="s2">Damon?</p>
<p begin="00:25:47.408" end="00:25:50.107" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Pretty well.</p>
<p begin="00:25:48.307" end="00:25:51.408" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good. Funny how things work out. My</p>
<p begin="00:25:50.107" end="00:25:52.908" style="s2">sister-in-law Martha works for his</p>
<p begin="00:25:51.408" end="00:25:54.807" style="s2">family. He was supposed to travel with</p>
<p begin="00:25:52.908" end="00:25:56.408" style="s2">his cousin Luca, then he canceled and</p>
<p begin="00:25:54.807" end="00:25:57.307" style="s2">came to Gray Haven early, said he had</p>
<p begin="00:25:56.408" end="00:25:58.908" style="s2">someone to meet.</p>
<p begin="00:25:57.307" end="00:26:00.507" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He changed his plans himself?</p>
<p begin="00:25:58.908" end="00:26:03.107" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes. He&#39;s older than you, but that can</p>
<p begin="00:26:00.507" end="00:26:05.507" style="s2">be a good thing. Steady, consider it.</p>
<p begin="00:26:03.107" end="00:26:06.807" style="s2">Don&#39;t dismiss him too quickly.</p>
<p begin="00:26:05.507" end="00:26:09.107" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you. I should get back to</p>
<p begin="00:26:06.807" end="00:26:09.107" style="s2">training.</p>
<p begin="00:26:10.607" end="00:26:14.707" style="s2">Something&#39;s off, very off. He doesn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:26:12.807" end="00:26:16.707" style="s2">change plans for just anyone. When he&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:26:14.707" end="00:26:19.007" style="s2">back, I &#39;m asking him exactly why he</p>
<p begin="00:26:16.707" end="00:26:19.007" style="s2">came.</p>
<p begin="00:26:20.707" end="00:26:24.207" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey, I was watching Lucky.</p>
<p begin="00:26:24.607" end="00:26:27.908" style="s2">He&#39;s my favorite dancer. Those mask</p>
<p begin="00:26:26.307" end="00:26:29.707" style="s2">shows are incredible. He&#39;s got a whole</p>
<p begin="00:26:27.908" end="00:26:31.709" style="s2">hockey routine called After Hours with</p>
<p begin="00:26:29.707" end="00:26:34.109" style="s2">the Captain. The Captain he acts out is</p>
<p begin="00:26:31.709" end="00:26:34.809" style="s2">a lot like you. Same look, same serious</p>
<p begin="00:26:34.109" end="00:26:36.409" style="s2">face.</p>
<p begin="00:26:34.809" end="00:26:37.709" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That wrist tap.</p>
<p begin="00:26:36.409" end="00:26:39.009" style="s2">Noah used to do that when he was</p>
<p begin="00:26:37.709" end="00:26:39.809" style="s2">nervous. Where can I watch his</p>
<p begin="00:26:39.009" end="00:26:41.909" style="s2">performances?</p>
<p begin="00:26:39.809" end="00:26:44.009" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Clips are everywhere. Velvet posts the</p>
<p begin="00:26:41.909" end="00:26:45.509" style="s2">originals. Watch a few. You&#39;ll fall for</p>
<p begin="00:26:44.009" end="00:26:47.109" style="s2">him.</p>
<p begin="00:26:45.509" end="00:26:48.909" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Those two betting fixers you reported</p>
<p begin="00:26:47.109" end="00:26:51.509" style="s2">three years ago, they were arrested near</p>
<p begin="00:26:48.909" end="00:26:52.709" style="s2">the border this week.</p>
<p begin="00:26:51.509" end="00:26:54.709" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s good news.</p>
<p begin="00:26:52.709" end="00:26:56.009" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They threatened whoever reported them.</p>
<p begin="00:26:54.709" end="00:26:57.709" style="s2">Every away trip we worried they&#39;d come</p>
<p begin="00:26:56.009" end="00:26:59.209" style="s2">after you.</p>
<p begin="00:26:57.709" end="00:27:02.109" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They&#39;re finally locked up. We can</p>
<p begin="00:26:59.209" end="00:27:03.509" style="s2">breathe again. So can you, Damon.</p>
<p begin="00:27:02.109" end="00:27:05.509" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s over.</p>
<p begin="00:27:03.509" end="00:27:07.409" style="s2">Finally.</p>
<p begin="00:27:05.509" end="00:27:08.809" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I was inspecting the hotel today. Men</p>
<p begin="00:27:07.409" end="00:27:11.209" style="s2">came in with bats and started swinging</p>
<p begin="00:27:08.809" end="00:27:15.109" style="s2">at everyone. Without my guards I&#39;d be in</p>
<p begin="00:27:11.209" end="00:27:16.509" style="s2">intensive care. Can&#39;t you leave hockey?</p>
<p begin="00:27:15.109" end="00:27:19.509" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t have to worry about them coming</p>
<p begin="00:27:16.509" end="00:27:19.509" style="s2">after us anymore.</p>
<p begin="00:27:20.009" end="00:27:23.109" style="s2">I can finally be with him.</p>
<p begin="00:27:26.688" end="00:27:29.909" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [clears throat]</p>
<p begin="00:27:26.909" end="00:27:29.909" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where are you staying tonight?</p>
<p begin="00:27:31.929" end="00:27:33.949" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:27:37.169" end="00:27:40.709" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:27:38.709" end="00:27:43.609" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Grandpa, I mean an address where you can</p>
<p begin="00:27:40.709" end="00:27:43.609" style="s2">receive a package.</p>
<p begin="00:27:45.029" end="00:27:46.309" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:27:45.309" end="00:27:47.509" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What are you sending me?</p>
<p begin="00:27:46.309" end="00:27:50.209" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Those books you gave me were very</p>
<p begin="00:27:47.509" end="00:27:53.109" style="s2">educational, so I&#39;m returning the favor.</p>
<p begin="00:27:50.209" end="00:27:54.709" style="s2">I&#39;ve got a big gift for you.</p>
<p begin="00:27:53.109" end="00:27:57.209" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What gift?</p>
<p begin="00:27:54.709" end="00:27:58.409" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You really don&#39;t get surprises, do you?</p>
<p begin="00:27:57.209" end="00:28:01.009" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If I tell you now it won&#39;t be a</p>
<p begin="00:27:58.409" end="00:28:01.009" style="s2">surprise.</p>
<p begin="00:28:02.109" end="00:28:06.044" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then I won&#39;t ask.</p>
<p begin="00:28:04.024" end="00:28:06.044" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:28:07.909" end="00:28:11.809" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Got it. Just wait for the [music]</p>
<p begin="00:28:09.309" end="00:28:11.809" style="s2">delivery.</p>
<p begin="00:28:17.809" end="00:28:20.109" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Open it. Let&#39;s see what your young</p>
<p begin="00:28:19.109" end="00:28:22.409" style="s2">boyfriend sent you.</p>
<p begin="00:28:20.109" end="00:28:22.409" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hm.</p>
<p begin="00:28:23.909" end="00:28:29.309" style="s2">Thoughtful boyfriend. I&#39;m asking my wife</p>
<p begin="00:28:25.709" end="00:28:29.309" style="s2">for one if other men get presents.</p>
<p begin="00:28:29.809" end="00:28:33.499" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Retired hockey star care kit. Now I get</p>
<p begin="00:28:32.609" end="00:28:33.710" style="s2">it, Damon.</p>
<p begin="00:28:33.499" end="00:28:36.510" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:28:33.710" end="00:28:38.010" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Retirement. Warm feet, soft hands, and</p>
<p begin="00:28:36.510" end="00:28:40.010" style="s2">bed by nine.</p>
<p begin="00:28:38.010" end="00:28:41.510" style="s2">Keep training, get your beauty sleep,</p>
<p begin="00:28:40.010" end="00:28:43.510" style="s2">use the whole kit. You&#39;ll be back in</p>
<p begin="00:28:41.510" end="00:28:45.210" style="s2">fighting shape.</p>
<p begin="00:28:43.510" end="00:28:47.110" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He seems to think retirement means I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:28:45.210" end="00:28:48.510" style="s2">worn out.</p>
<p begin="00:28:47.110" end="00:28:51.210" style="s2">Next time, I&#39;ll give him a proper</p>
<p begin="00:28:48.510" end="00:28:51.210" style="s2">demonstration.</p>
<p begin="00:28:52.110" end="00:28:56.210" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Listen up. Today&#39;s team event is at The</p>
<p begin="00:28:54.110" end="00:28:58.110" style="s2">Raven. It&#39;s our best chance to introduce</p>
<p begin="00:28:56.210" end="00:28:59.510" style="s2">the wolves to new supporters. The</p>
<p begin="00:28:58.110" end="00:29:00.710" style="s2">sponsors paid for this, so make it</p>
<p begin="00:28:59.510" end="00:29:02.910" style="s2">count.</p>
<p begin="00:29:00.710" end="00:29:03.810" style="s2">Noah, can you lead the group?</p>
<p begin="00:29:02.910" end="00:29:05.410" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You can count on me.</p>
<p begin="00:29:03.810" end="00:29:07.810" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good. Look after each other. Stay safe.</p>
<p begin="00:29:05.410" end="00:29:07.810" style="s2">Let&#39;s go.</p>
<p begin="00:29:08.810" end="00:29:11.310" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I &#39;m on crowd duty.</p>
<p begin="00:29:10.410" end="00:29:13.310" style="s2">I&#39;ll keep our guys from turning the</p>
<p begin="00:29:11.310" end="00:29:14.410" style="s2">place upside down. Thanks, Mason. I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:29:13.310" end="00:29:15.610" style="s2">leave that part to you.</p>
<p begin="00:29:14.410" end="00:29:17.410" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll take this for you. I can manage.</p>
<p begin="00:29:15.610" end="00:29:19.710" style="s2">Come on. We&#39;re teammates.</p>
<p begin="00:29:17.410" end="00:29:19.710" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thanks.</p>
<p begin="00:29:22.610" end="00:29:27.210" style="s2">First the retirement kit. Now I turn up</p>
<p begin="00:29:24.910" end="00:29:28.110" style="s2">at his hotel. Damon Cole is in for a</p>
<p begin="00:29:27.210" end="00:29:29.710" style="s2">surprise.</p>
<p begin="00:29:28.110" end="00:29:31.110" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He hasn&#39;t touched his food. That look</p>
<p begin="00:29:29.710" end="00:29:32.810" style="s2">could kill.</p>
<p begin="00:29:31.110" end="00:29:34.610" style="s2">Did the young boyfriend dump him?</p>
<p begin="00:29:32.810" end="00:29:37.110" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I hope not. It took him long enough to</p>
<p begin="00:29:34.610" end="00:29:38.010" style="s2">find someone.</p>
<p begin="00:29:37.110" end="00:29:39.110" style="s2">I&#39;ll get everyone checked out and</p>
<p begin="00:29:38.010" end="00:29:39.610" style="s2">downstairs before they start wandering</p>
<p begin="00:29:39.110" end="00:29:41.710" style="s2">off.</p>
<p begin="00:29:39.610" end="00:29:41.710" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay.</p>
<p begin="00:29:43.310" end="00:29:47.710" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let me get that. You don&#39;t have to. It&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:29:44.910" end="00:29:47.710" style="s2">fine. Thanks.</p>
<p begin="00:29:56.010" end="00:29:58.910" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Noah,</p>
<p begin="00:29:56.910" end="00:30:01.210" style="s2">2 hours and 15 minutes without a word.</p>
<p begin="00:29:58.910" end="00:30:02.810" style="s2">You coach, I wasn&#39;t ignoring you. Guess</p>
<p begin="00:30:01.210" end="00:30:04.210" style="s2">where I am.</p>
<p begin="00:30:02.810" end="00:30:05.910" style="s2">I brought the team to The Raven for the</p>
<p begin="00:30:04.210" end="00:30:08.910" style="s2">event.</p>
<p begin="00:30:05.910" end="00:30:08.910" style="s2">Surprise.</p>
<p begin="00:30:10.110" end="00:30:13.510" style="s2">Where in the hotel? They&#39;ve let me use a</p>
<p begin="00:30:11.910" end="00:30:16.410" style="s2">suite to change after the event. You&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:30:13.510" end="00:30:19.610" style="s2">still across town, though.</p>
<p begin="00:30:16.410" end="00:30:19.610" style="s2">What was that supposed to mean?</p>
<p begin="00:30:22.110" end="00:30:27.510" style="s2">I &#39;m at your door. What? You&#39;re here?</p>
<p begin="00:30:24.710" end="00:30:27.510" style="s2">This is a bad idea.</p>
<p begin="00:30:27.910" end="00:30:34.210" style="s2">It late and we&#39;d be alone.</p>
<p begin="00:30:30.910" end="00:30:34.210" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Too late. Open the door.</p>
<p begin="00:30:36.210" end="00:30:40.312" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Aren&#39;t you going to invite me in?</p>
<p begin="00:30:39.012" end="00:30:42.512" style="s2">Just us</p>
<p begin="00:30:40.312" end="00:30:44.812" style="s2">in a hotel suite with that bed right</p>
<p begin="00:30:42.512" end="00:30:44.812" style="s2">there.</p>
<p begin="00:30:47.512" end="00:30:50.412" style="s2">Make yourself comfortable. How</p>
<p begin="00:30:49.212" end="00:30:54.012" style="s2">comfortable?</p>
<p begin="00:30:50.412" end="00:30:54.012" style="s2">I meant take a seat on the couch.</p>
<p begin="00:30:56.912" end="00:31:00.712" style="s2">Why turn up at my hotel without telling</p>
<p begin="00:30:58.512" end="00:31:01.912" style="s2">me? To give you a scare and check</p>
<p begin="00:31:00.712" end="00:31:04.812" style="s2">whether you&#39;re using that retirement</p>
<p begin="00:31:01.912" end="00:31:04.812" style="s2">care kit I sent.</p>
<p begin="00:31:05.112" end="00:31:09.012" style="s2">So you came to inspect the results? No</p>
<p begin="00:31:07.412" end="00:31:11.112" style="s2">inspection needed.</p>
<p begin="00:31:09.012" end="00:31:13.012" style="s2">I believe you&#39;re in good shape.</p>
<p begin="00:31:11.112" end="00:31:14.212" style="s2">That won&#39;t [music] do. In hockey, nobody</p>
<p begin="00:31:13.012" end="00:31:17.012" style="s2">gets credit for a performance you</p>
<p begin="00:31:14.212" end="00:31:17.012" style="s2">haven&#39;t actually seen.</p>
<p begin="00:31:18.812" end="00:31:23.312" style="s2">What does that mean?</p>
<p begin="00:31:20.412" end="00:31:23.312" style="s2">Give him something to look at.</p>
<p begin="00:31:24.612" end="00:31:28.112" style="s2">Since you went to the trouble of coming</p>
<p begin="00:31:26.212" end="00:31:30.912" style="s2">here, I should give you a complete</p>
<p begin="00:31:28.112" end="00:31:32.712" style="s2">demonstration of my fitness. Damon,</p>
<p begin="00:31:30.912" end="00:31:34.712" style="s2">don&#39;t start. You sent me a kit for</p>
<p begin="00:31:32.712" end="00:31:36.112" style="s2">worn-out men then came to find me. I</p>
<p begin="00:31:34.712" end="00:31:39.012" style="s2">thought you wanted proof that I&#39;m still</p>
<p begin="00:31:36.112" end="00:31:39.012" style="s2">very much alive.</p>
<p begin="00:31:47.412" end="00:31:50.912" style="s2">How long are you here?</p>
<p begin="00:31:49.712" end="00:31:52.612" style="s2">A week.</p>
<p begin="00:31:50.912" end="00:31:53.912" style="s2">You&#39;ve been on your feet all day.</p>
<p begin="00:31:52.612" end="00:31:56.012" style="s2">Hungry? [music] Want to get something</p>
<p begin="00:31:53.912" end="00:31:57.712" style="s2">downstairs? I&#39;ll skip it. I&#39;ve put on</p>
<p begin="00:31:56.012" end="00:31:59.512" style="s2">four or five pounds lately. You&#39;ve got a</p>
<p begin="00:31:57.712" end="00:32:01.912" style="s2">lean frame. [music] A few pounds won&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:31:59.512" end="00:32:03.412" style="s2">change that. You&#39;re at a healthy weight.</p>
<p begin="00:32:01.912" end="00:32:04.212" style="s2">You don&#39;t need to skip meals and you</p>
<p begin="00:32:03.412" end="00:32:06.412" style="s2">look good.</p>
<p begin="00:32:04.212" end="00:32:07.912" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh god, when did this old-school man</p>
<p begin="00:32:06.412" end="00:32:09.212" style="s2">learn to hit that hard?</p>
<p begin="00:32:07.912" end="00:32:11.412" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Can I see your schedule for the rest of</p>
<p begin="00:32:09.212" end="00:32:13.312" style="s2">the week?</p>
<p begin="00:32:11.412" end="00:32:14.812" style="s2">It&#39;s right here.</p>
<p begin="00:32:13.312" end="00:32:19.112" style="s2">They&#39;ve packed [music] it in.</p>
<p begin="00:32:14.812" end="00:32:20.912" style="s2">Fan events, rink tours, meet and greets.</p>
<p begin="00:32:19.112" end="00:32:22.312" style="s2">You&#39;re [music]</p>
<p begin="00:32:20.912" end="00:32:24.112" style="s2">Since when are you interested in fan</p>
<p begin="00:32:22.312" end="00:32:25.712" style="s2">tours?</p>
<p begin="00:32:24.112" end="00:32:28.012" style="s2">I&#39;m interested in where a certain player</p>
<p begin="00:32:25.712" end="00:32:29.512" style="s2">will be.</p>
<p begin="00:32:28.012" end="00:32:30.912" style="s2">If you really want to come, I could ask</p>
<p begin="00:32:29.512" end="00:32:31.812" style="s2">the organizer to squeeze you onto the</p>
<p begin="00:32:30.912" end="00:32:33.952" style="s2">guest list.</p>
<p begin="00:32:31.812" end="00:32:33.952" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No need. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:32:34.112" end="00:32:37.512" style="s2">It&#39;s late. I should head back.</p>
<p begin="00:32:37.812" end="00:32:42.113" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Already?</p>
<p begin="00:32:38.912" end="00:32:42.113" style="s2">You don&#39;t want to stay a little longer?</p>
<p begin="00:32:44.313" end="00:32:50.013" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you asking me to stay, Noah?</p>
<p begin="00:32:47.813" end="00:32:51.513" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Asking a grown man to stay in your hotel</p>
<p begin="00:32:50.013" end="00:32:54.013" style="s2">room this late. [music] Do you know what</p>
<p begin="00:32:51.513" end="00:32:56.513" style="s2">that sounds like?</p>
<p begin="00:32:54.013" end="00:32:57.813" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I wasn&#39;t. Besides, who am I to make the</p>
<p begin="00:32:56.513" end="00:32:59.513" style="s2">great Damon Cole stay?</p>
<p begin="00:32:57.813" end="00:33:01.513" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My boyfriend?</p>
<p begin="00:32:59.513" end="00:33:03.813" style="s2">Boyfriend?</p>
<p begin="00:33:01.513" end="00:33:05.913" style="s2">Isn&#39;t that moving a little fast?</p>
<p begin="00:33:03.813" end="00:33:07.413" style="s2">If I haven&#39;t earned that yet, can I at</p>
<p begin="00:33:05.913" end="00:33:09.313" style="s2">least have a name for you that&#39;s just</p>
<p begin="00:33:07.413" end="00:33:10.567" style="s2">mine?</p>
<p begin="00:33:09.313" end="00:33:11.313" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Noey.</p>
<p begin="00:33:10.567" end="00:33:13.013" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:33:11.313" end="00:33:14.497" style="s2">My mom and grandma call me that. How is</p>
<p begin="00:33:13.013" end="00:33:14.913" style="s2">that just yours?</p>
<p begin="00:33:14.497" end="00:33:17.113" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:33:14.913" end="00:33:19.713" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Coach, if you want a special name, you</p>
<p begin="00:33:17.113" end="00:33:19.713" style="s2">could call me</p>
<p begin="00:33:21.048" end="00:33:23.313" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs and gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:33:21.713" end="00:33:24.813" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course he can&#39;t say it. A man that</p>
<p begin="00:33:23.313" end="00:33:26.313" style="s2">proper would choke on something that</p>
<p begin="00:33:24.813" end="00:33:28.513" style="s2">sweet.</p>
<p begin="00:33:26.313" end="00:33:30.113" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Baby.</p>
<p begin="00:33:28.513" end="00:33:32.183" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What? Do I need special permission to</p>
<p begin="00:33:30.113" end="00:33:34.203" style="s2">call you that?</p>
<p begin="00:33:32.183" end="00:33:34.203" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [panting]</p>
<p begin="00:33:36.213" end="00:33:39.013" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s enough for tonight. I&#39;m really</p>
<p begin="00:33:37.513" end="00:33:40.413" style="s2">going now.</p>
<p begin="00:33:39.013" end="00:33:43.013" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Get some rest</p>
<p begin="00:33:40.413" end="00:33:43.013" style="s2">and lock the [music] door.</p>
<p begin="00:33:45.913" end="00:33:50.513" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh God.</p>
<p begin="00:33:47.513" end="00:33:53.713" style="s2">That man knows exactly what he&#39;s doing.</p>
<p begin="00:33:50.513" end="00:33:53.713" style="s2">How am I supposed to handle that?</p>
<p begin="00:33:57.073" end="00:33:59.113" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:33:57.113" end="00:34:02.113" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sorry. I pushed things a little tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:33:59.113" end="00:34:02.113" style="s2">Did I scare you, baby?</p>
<p begin="00:34:04.278" end="00:34:06.513" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:34:05.213" end="00:34:08.013" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A little.</p>
<p begin="00:34:06.513" end="00:34:10.013" style="s2">But coach, was that really a</p>
<p begin="00:34:08.013" end="00:34:12.813" style="s2">demonstration or just an excuse to put</p>
<p begin="00:34:10.013" end="00:34:12.813" style="s2">your hands on me?</p>
<p begin="00:34:16.213" end="00:34:21.413" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re one of a kind. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:34:18.113" end="00:34:21.413" style="s2">Of course I want a closer look.</p>
<p begin="00:34:21.913" end="00:34:24.813" style="s2">I got carried away.</p>
<p begin="00:34:25.913" end="00:34:30.613" style="s2">&gt;&gt; With lines like that, coach, you belong</p>
<p begin="00:34:28.013" end="00:34:32.713" style="s2">on stage.</p>
<p begin="00:34:30.613" end="00:34:34.513" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m better in person.</p>
<p begin="00:34:32.713" end="00:34:37.213" style="s2">But if a certain future star needs real</p>
<p begin="00:34:34.513" end="00:34:39.713" style="s2">life inspiration for his dancing,</p>
<p begin="00:34:37.213" end="00:34:41.213" style="s2">I&#39;m happy to help.</p>
<p begin="00:34:39.713" end="00:34:43.014" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What does he mean?</p>
<p begin="00:34:41.213" end="00:34:44.514" style="s2">Does he know I build Lucky&#39;s routines</p>
<p begin="00:34:43.014" end="00:34:47.114" style="s2">around him?</p>
<p begin="00:34:44.514" end="00:34:48.614" style="s2">No, I keep that stage name buried. He</p>
<p begin="00:34:47.114" end="00:34:49.714" style="s2">lives at the rink. How would he ever</p>
<p begin="00:34:48.614" end="00:34:51.214" style="s2">find it?</p>
<p begin="00:34:49.714" end="00:34:52.314" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Henry, thanks for fitting our group into</p>
<p begin="00:34:51.214" end="00:34:54.014" style="s2">your schedule.</p>
<p begin="00:34:52.314" end="00:34:57.214" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You picked the right day.</p>
<p begin="00:34:54.014" end="00:35:01.214" style="s2">One of hockey&#39;s biggest names is here.</p>
<p begin="00:34:57.214" end="00:35:01.214" style="s2">I asked him to give you the full tour.</p>
<p begin="00:35:09.514" end="00:35:13.314" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Damon Clark, hockey legend and the</p>
<p begin="00:35:11.614" end="00:35:14.914" style="s2">Wolves&#39; new head coach.</p>
<p begin="00:35:13.314" end="00:35:17.114" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh god, he actually came to be our tour</p>
<p begin="00:35:14.914" end="00:35:17.114" style="s2">guide.</p>
<p begin="00:35:17.214" end="00:35:21.114" style="s2">Noah,</p>
<p begin="00:35:18.714" end="00:35:21.114" style="s2">good to see you.</p>
<p begin="00:35:21.514" end="00:35:25.514" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You too. Damon&#39;s usually impossible to</p>
<p begin="00:35:24.014" end="00:35:28.114" style="s2">book.</p>
<p begin="00:35:25.514" end="00:35:30.084" style="s2">Make the most of having him here.</p>
<p begin="00:35:28.114" end="00:35:32.014" style="s2">I&#39;ll leave this group with you. Happy to</p>
<p begin="00:35:30.084" end="00:35:34.214" style="s2">[music] help, especially this particular</p>
<p begin="00:35:32.014" end="00:35:34.214" style="s2">group.</p>
<p begin="00:35:36.814" end="00:35:41.314" style="s2">This puck is from the Wolves&#39; first</p>
<p begin="00:35:38.714" end="00:35:43.614" style="s2">playoff win. They were two goals down,</p>
<p begin="00:35:41.314" end="00:35:46.214" style="s2">tied it in the final minute, then won in</p>
<p begin="00:35:43.614" end="00:35:46.214" style="s2">overtime.</p>
<p begin="00:35:46.614" end="00:35:51.114" style="s2">He joined my event just to lead</p>
<p begin="00:35:48.114" end="00:35:54.314" style="s2">strangers around the rink for me.</p>
<p begin="00:35:51.114" end="00:35:54.314" style="s2">How am I supposed to resist that?</p>
<p begin="00:35:54.814" end="00:35:57.014" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Noah,</p>
<p begin="00:35:58.014" end="00:36:01.014" style="s2">room temperature. Easier on your</p>
<p begin="00:35:59.614" end="00:36:03.914" style="s2">stomach.</p>
<p begin="00:36:01.014" end="00:36:06.109" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thanks, Mason. I&#39;ve got a drink.</p>
<p begin="00:36:03.914" end="00:36:08.014" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All that walking makes you thirsty.</p>
<p begin="00:36:06.109" end="00:36:10.314" style="s2">[music] Have mine. Your voice is nearly</p>
<p begin="00:36:08.014" end="00:36:10.314" style="s2">gone.</p>
<p begin="00:36:11.814" end="00:36:16.514" style="s2">You&#39;ve had some. Your voice is gone and</p>
<p begin="00:36:13.614" end="00:36:16.514" style="s2">you&#39;re worried about sharing a cup?</p>
<p begin="00:36:16.589" end="00:36:20.514" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:36:18.214" end="00:36:20.514" style="s2">Better.</p>
<p begin="00:36:21.914" end="00:36:25.714" style="s2">How did you end up leading the tour?</p>
<p begin="00:36:24.314" end="00:36:28.514" style="s2">I know Henry.</p>
<p begin="00:36:25.714" end="00:36:28.514" style="s2">I asked him for the job.</p>
<p begin="00:36:29.214" end="00:36:33.314" style="s2">For me? Who else could get me to spend</p>
<p begin="00:36:31.014" end="00:36:34.930" style="s2">my free time repeating the same tour?</p>
<p begin="00:36:33.314" end="00:36:36.314" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then I&#39;m honored. Don&#39;t tell everyone.</p>
<p begin="00:36:34.930" end="00:36:38.614" style="s2">[music] This service is only available</p>
<p begin="00:36:36.314" end="00:36:38.614" style="s2">to you.</p>
<p begin="00:36:39.914" end="00:36:43.914" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Noah,</p>
<p begin="00:36:41.214" end="00:36:44.716" style="s2">and what are you two?</p>
<p begin="00:36:43.914" end="00:36:47.016" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Friends. Coach</p>
<p begin="00:36:44.716" end="00:36:49.516" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Cole is helping with the open day.</p>
<p begin="00:36:47.016" end="00:36:51.116" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hello, coach. Friends share a cup now?</p>
<p begin="00:36:49.516" end="00:36:52.616" style="s2">At this rate, we&#39;ll be getting a wedding</p>
<p begin="00:36:51.116" end="00:36:54.916" style="s2">invitation.</p>
<p begin="00:36:52.616" end="00:36:56.216" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A star like coach Cole doing a fan tour.</p>
<p begin="00:36:54.916" end="00:36:57.216" style="s2">We&#39;re all benefiting from Noah&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:36:56.216" end="00:36:58.716" style="s2">connections.</p>
<p begin="00:36:57.216" end="00:37:00.816" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m the one who&#39;s lucky to help Noah.</p>
<p begin="00:36:58.716" end="00:37:03.216" style="s2">This isn&#39;t about anyone else.</p>
<p begin="00:37:00.816" end="00:37:06.516" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s quite a catch, Noah. Pay attention.</p>
<p begin="00:37:03.216" end="00:37:06.516" style="s2">Don&#39;t take forever to make up your mind.</p>
<p begin="00:37:09.016" end="00:37:13.616" style="s2">We&#39;re all here for dinner. Come wait in</p>
<p begin="00:37:10.716" end="00:37:15.716" style="s2">the lounge with us, coach.</p>
<p begin="00:37:13.616" end="00:37:17.616" style="s2">There are seats at the back.</p>
<p begin="00:37:15.716" end="00:37:18.616" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you, Grace. I hope I&#39;m not making</p>
<p begin="00:37:17.616" end="00:37:20.916" style="s2">more work for you.</p>
<p begin="00:37:18.616" end="00:37:23.016" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stay together.</p>
<p begin="00:37:20.916" end="00:37:24.816" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let&#39;s sit here.</p>
<p begin="00:37:23.016" end="00:37:26.516" style="s2">Tight squeeze back here, coach. With</p>
<p begin="00:37:24.816" end="00:37:28.116" style="s2">those legs, you&#39;d be more comfortable up</p>
<p begin="00:37:26.516" end="00:37:29.716" style="s2">front. Thanks, but I can see the</p>
<p begin="00:37:28.116" end="00:37:31.516" style="s2">entrance from here. Better place to keep</p>
<p begin="00:37:29.716" end="00:37:33.816" style="s2">an eye on everyone. Fine.</p>
<p begin="00:37:31.516" end="00:37:35.716" style="s2">Keep watching.</p>
<p begin="00:37:33.816" end="00:37:39.016" style="s2">Noah, it&#39;s cold in here.</p>
<p begin="00:37:35.716" end="00:37:39.016" style="s2">Cover up before you catch something.</p>
<p begin="00:37:39.316" end="00:37:43.316" style="s2">Thoughtful of you, but that wool makes</p>
<p begin="00:37:40.716" end="00:37:45.416" style="s2">some itch. Better keep it for yourself.</p>
<p begin="00:37:43.316" end="00:37:46.616" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mason, Noah&#39;s watching this end. I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:37:45.416" end="00:37:48.116" style="s2">stay in the middle. Can you cover the</p>
<p begin="00:37:46.616" end="00:37:51.621" style="s2">entrance?</p>
<p begin="00:37:48.116" end="00:37:51.621" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They need you up front, Mason. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:37:53.816" end="00:37:58.916" style="s2">Aren&#39;t you busy today?</p>
<p begin="00:37:56.216" end="00:37:58.916" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Took the day off.</p>
<p begin="00:37:59.426" end="00:38:03.616" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:38:01.316" end="00:38:05.816" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Still fall asleep anywhere.</p>
<p begin="00:38:03.616" end="00:38:07.816" style="s2">Still fall asleep anywhere.</p>
<p begin="00:38:05.816" end="00:38:10.016" style="s2">At those fan events, I used Then he</p>
