<p begin="00:38:10.016" end="00:38:13.416" style="s2">That&#39;s when I realized not seeing him</p>
<p begin="00:38:11.716" end="00:38:15.316" style="s2">was worse than watching him sleep.</p>
<p begin="00:38:13.416" end="00:38:17.416" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, Luca. He was supposed to travel</p>
