<p begin="00:38:17.416" end="00:38:21.816" style="s2">going to Gray Haven.</p>
<p begin="00:38:19.116" end="00:38:23.716" style="s2">No, he asked me to cancel it himself.</p>
<p begin="00:38:21.816" end="00:38:24.616" style="s2">There&#39;s someone he has to see.</p>
<p begin="00:38:23.716" end="00:38:27.616" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Maybe we were always [music] going to</p>
<p begin="00:38:24.616" end="00:38:27.616" style="s2">find our way back.</p>
<p begin="00:38:29.316" end="00:38:34.916" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Awake finally. You were out cold.</p>
<p begin="00:38:33.116" end="00:38:36.516" style="s2">Where is everyone?</p>
<p begin="00:38:34.916" end="00:38:38.316" style="s2">Dinner. [music] You were sleeping like a</p>
<p begin="00:38:36.516" end="00:38:39.316" style="s2">little pig, so I told them not to wake</p>
<p begin="00:38:38.316" end="00:38:42.716" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="00:38:39.316" end="00:38:42.716" style="s2">You&#39;re the pig. Come on, let&#39;s go.</p>
<p begin="00:38:45.916" end="00:38:48.817" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Coach, what if I said I was checking</p>
<p begin="00:38:47.517" end="00:38:50.717" style="s2">your core strength? How would you like</p>
<p begin="00:38:48.817" end="00:38:52.817" style="s2">to check? Just look [music] or use your</p>
<p begin="00:38:50.717" end="00:38:55.101" style="s2">hands?</p>
<p begin="00:38:52.817" end="00:38:55.717" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What are you doing? That&#39;s not fair.</p>
<p begin="00:38:55.101" end="00:38:57.817" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:38:55.717" end="00:38:58.917" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You had your hands on me first. I&#39;m just</p>
<p begin="00:38:57.817" end="00:39:00.517" style="s2">collecting interest.</p>
<p begin="00:38:58.917" end="00:39:01.917" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;ve got my waist now. We&#39;re even.</p>
<p begin="00:39:00.517" end="00:39:04.517" style="s2">Neither of us gets to complain.</p>
<p begin="00:39:01.917" end="00:39:07.317" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Even? You think this is trouble? This is</p>
<p begin="00:39:04.517" end="00:39:09.417" style="s2">barely the warm up.</p>
<p begin="00:39:07.317" end="00:39:12.017" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay, I&#39;m sorry. I&#39;m actually starving.</p>
<p begin="00:39:09.417" end="00:39:12.017" style="s2">Can we go eat?</p>
<p begin="00:39:12.132" end="00:39:14.717" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [panting]</p>
<p begin="00:39:13.517" end="00:39:17.817" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine.</p>
<p begin="00:39:14.717" end="00:39:17.817" style="s2">You&#39;re off the hook this time.</p>
<p begin="00:39:19.117" end="00:39:23.917" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s the one putting his hands on me.</p>
<p begin="00:39:20.917" end="00:39:26.617" style="s2">How did I end up owing him?</p>
<p begin="00:39:23.917" end="00:39:26.617" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Those look good.</p>
<p begin="00:39:26.817" end="00:39:29.717" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Watch where you&#39;re going.</p>
<p begin="00:39:29.817" end="00:39:32.117" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What do you want to eat? Dinner service</p>
<p begin="00:39:31.117" end="00:39:35.217" style="s2">ends in half an hour. Let&#39;s get</p>
<p begin="00:39:32.117" end="00:39:36.117" style="s2">something simple. Pasta?</p>
<p begin="00:39:35.217" end="00:39:37.317" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Could I have one of [music] those?</p>
