<p begin="00:39:37.317" end="00:39:41.917" style="s2">&gt;&gt; White and dark chocolate.</p>
<p begin="00:39:39.217" end="00:39:43.917" style="s2">Paid. Thank you.</p>
<p begin="00:39:41.917" end="00:39:45.317" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Coach, do you know why they make these?</p>
