<p begin="00:39:48.417" end="00:39:51.517" style="s2">know that. So they were for the</p>
<p begin="00:39:50.017" end="00:39:53.017" style="s2">important people.</p>
<p begin="00:39:51.517" end="00:39:55.317" style="s2">Which makes you very important.</p>
