<p begin="00:40:10.117" end="00:40:13.817" style="s2">just wasting time.</p>
<p begin="00:40:11.317" end="00:40:14.717" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad, he&#39;s old and he gets a cookie. I</p>
<p begin="00:40:13.817" end="00:40:18.342" style="s2">want one, too.</p>
<p begin="00:40:14.717" end="00:40:18.342" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Come on. Let&#39;s go. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:40:19.417" end="00:40:22.417" style="s2">That kid definitely needs his eyes</p>
<p begin="00:40:20.817" end="00:40:25.217" style="s2">checked.</p>
