<p begin="00:40:25.217" end="00:40:29.017" style="s2">not old.</p>
<p begin="00:40:26.417" end="00:40:30.117" style="s2">So I&#39;m already an antique to you.</p>
<p begin="00:40:29.017" end="00:40:31.717" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:40:30.117" end="00:40:33.817" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, I&#39;ve been looking everywhere. Your</p>
<p begin="00:40:31.717" end="00:40:37.317" style="s2">favorite, barbecue ribs.</p>
<p begin="00:40:33.817" end="00:40:37.317" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thanks, Mason. I&#39;m okay.</p>
