<p begin="00:41:08.318" end="00:41:11.918" style="s2">Hear that? Stop talking down to him. He</p>
<p begin="00:41:10.518" end="00:41:13.963" style="s2">needs someone who can keep up with him,</p>
<p begin="00:41:11.918" end="00:41:15.983" style="s2">not another parent.</p>
<p begin="00:41:13.963" end="00:41:15.983" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
