<p begin="00:42:10.518" end="00:42:14.818" style="s2">But no, thanks. I&#39;ll get a ride myself.</p>
<p begin="00:42:13.418" end="00:42:16.218" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Must be fate.</p>
<p begin="00:42:14.818" end="00:42:18.218" style="s2">Heavy lifting is what young guys are</p>
