<p begin="00:42:20.518" end="00:42:23.818" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t talk about Damon like that again.</p>
<p begin="00:42:22.418" end="00:42:26.318" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ve liked you since my first day on the</p>
<p begin="00:42:23.818" end="00:42:27.718" style="s2">team. I &#39;m telling you now, I want to</p>
