<p begin="00:42:31.718" end="00:42:34.618" style="s2">boyfriend.</p>
<p begin="00:42:33.018" end="00:42:36.418" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I like Damon.</p>
<p begin="00:42:34.618" end="00:42:37.818" style="s2">And his stamina is excellent, so stop</p>
