<p begin="00:42:37.818" end="00:42:40.918" style="s2">jokes again.</p>
<p begin="00:42:39.018" end="00:42:42.318" style="s2">My future boyfriend won&#39;t like them.</p>
<p begin="00:42:40.918" end="00:42:42.618" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You told me you weren&#39;t interested in</p>
<p begin="00:42:42.318" end="00:42:44.718" style="s2">him.</p>
<p begin="00:42:42.618" end="00:42:47.218" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I lied. I like him.</p>
<p begin="00:42:44.718" end="00:42:49.018" style="s2">I&#39;ve liked him for a long time.</p>
<p begin="00:42:47.218" end="00:42:51.620" style="s2">You won&#39;t even give me a chance. Fine.</p>
<p begin="00:42:49.018" end="00:42:54.220" style="s2">But I&#39;m still going to be your</p>
