<p begin="00:43:02.694" end="00:43:05.720" style="s2">[bell] Noah, coach Cole&#39;s in trouble.</p>
<p begin="00:43:04.420" end="00:43:07.620" style="s2">They&#39;re saying he took money to throw</p>
