<p begin="00:43:36.520" end="00:43:40.020" style="s2">I can&#39;t just force my way in, and he&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:43:38.620" end="00:43:41.620" style="s2">still not answering.</p>
<p begin="00:43:40.020" end="00:43:43.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your father got mixed up with men who</p>
<p begin="00:43:41.620" end="00:43:45.020" style="s2">fixed games.</p>
<p begin="00:43:43.120" end="00:43:46.720" style="s2">He called them business partners. When</p>
<p begin="00:43:45.020" end="00:43:48.720" style="s2">things went wrong, he left your mother</p>
<p begin="00:43:46.720" end="00:43:51.520" style="s2">to deal with the mess. Those people</p>
<p begin="00:43:48.720" end="00:43:53.620" style="s2">nearly ruined his life.</p>
<p begin="00:43:51.520" end="00:43:54.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Noah, you&#39;re calling your dad? I thought</p>
<p begin="00:43:53.620" end="00:43:56.420" style="s2">I&#39;d read the screen wrong. Don&#39;t call</p>
<p begin="00:43:54.920" end="00:43:58.320" style="s2">yourself that.</p>
<p begin="00:43:56.420" end="00:44:00.120" style="s2">All right, how have you been? Richard,</p>
<p begin="00:43:58.320" end="00:44:02.020" style="s2">I&#39;m not calling to catch up. Look at the</p>
<p begin="00:44:00.120" end="00:44:03.420" style="s2">picture I sent. Do you know that man or</p>
<p begin="00:44:02.020" end="00:44:04.420" style="s2">where the video was filmed?</p>
<p begin="00:44:03.420" end="00:44:06.220" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why are you asking about him? I haven&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:44:04.420" end="00:44:07.620" style="s2">dealt with those people in years.</p>
<p begin="00:44:06.220" end="00:44:09.820" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I just need to know if you recognize</p>
<p begin="00:44:07.620" end="00:44:09.820" style="s2">him.</p>
<p begin="00:44:09.920" end="00:44:13.020" style="s2">That&#39;s Vic Scarlo. I know the room. I&#39;ve</p>
<p begin="00:44:11.820" end="00:44:14.520" style="s2">been there, and I&#39;ll send you the</p>
<p begin="00:44:13.020" end="00:44:16.220" style="s2">address. But he&#39;s not just some guy who</p>
<p begin="00:44:14.520" end="00:44:17.120" style="s2">takes bets. His men carry guns.</p>
<p begin="00:44:16.220" end="00:44:17.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do you know I failed you and your</p>
<p begin="00:44:17.120" end="00:44:18.620" style="s2">mother?</p>
<p begin="00:44:17.520" end="00:44:21.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know I failed you and your mother, but</p>
<p begin="00:44:18.620" end="00:44:22.820" style="s2">listen to me. Stay away from him. I have</p>
<p begin="00:44:21.120" end="00:44:24.720" style="s2">to go.</p>
<p begin="00:44:22.820" end="00:44:28.620" style="s2">Tabron Monch, I have information about</p>
<p begin="00:44:24.720" end="00:44:28.620" style="s2">the video being used against Damon Cole.</p>
<p begin="00:44:31.120" end="00:44:33.140" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:44:37.015" end="00:44:42.620" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:44:38.620" end="00:44:42.620" style="s2">Coach, meet by the steps. Noah.</p>
<p begin="00:44:46.720" end="00:44:50.120" style="s2">You ran out with your shoes untied. You</p>
<p begin="00:44:48.320" end="00:44:52.720" style="s2">know better than that. [snorts] I came</p>
<p begin="00:44:50.120" end="00:44:53.921" style="s2">to check on you. No team, no replies. I</p>
<p begin="00:44:52.720" end="00:44:55.921" style="s2">thought you might be sitting out here</p>
<p begin="00:44:53.921" end="00:44:57.621" style="s2">sorry for yourself. How did you find</p>
<p begin="00:44:55.921" end="00:44:59.721" style="s2">out?</p>
<p begin="00:44:57.621" end="00:45:01.021" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We know you didn&#39;t take that money.</p>
<p begin="00:44:59.721" end="00:45:02.721" style="s2">You don&#39;t have to carry this alone. I</p>
<p begin="00:45:01.021" end="00:45:04.721" style="s2">gave the police a new lead. They should</p>
<p begin="00:45:02.721" end="00:45:06.421" style="s2">be able to clear it up soon. I kept you</p>
<p begin="00:45:04.721" end="00:45:09.521" style="s2">out of it because I was afraid you&#39;d get</p>
<p begin="00:45:06.421" end="00:45:11.221" style="s2">hurt. I thought I was protecting you.</p>
<p begin="00:45:09.521" end="00:45:13.221" style="s2">And you&#39;re the one who came to help me.</p>
<p begin="00:45:11.221" end="00:45:15.521" style="s2">So, does this mean you&#39;ll be my</p>
<p begin="00:45:13.221" end="00:45:16.971" style="s2">boyfriend?</p>
<p begin="00:45:15.521" end="00:45:18.991" style="s2">My boyfriend?</p>
<p begin="00:45:16.971" end="00:45:18.991" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:45:19.621" end="00:45:24.421" style="s2">Noah, you can just say no. You don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:45:21.521" end="00:45:25.921" style="s2">have to throw yourself down the steps.</p>
<p begin="00:45:24.421" end="00:45:27.321" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Did you really just ask me that?</p>
<p begin="00:45:25.921" end="00:45:28.821" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I did.</p>
<p begin="00:45:27.321" end="00:45:30.121" style="s2">When do I get an answer?</p>
<p begin="00:45:28.821" end="00:45:31.821" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Damon. Damon, you&#39;re getting ahead of</p>
<p begin="00:45:30.121" end="00:45:33.321" style="s2">yourself. I worked hard to get this</p>
<p begin="00:45:31.821" end="00:45:34.721" style="s2">chance. Now that I have it, I&#39;m not</p>
<p begin="00:45:33.321" end="00:45:35.821" style="s2">wasting time pretending I don&#39;t want</p>
<p begin="00:45:34.721" end="00:45:37.121" style="s2">you. Wanting me doesn&#39;t make you my</p>
<p begin="00:45:35.821" end="00:45:38.321" style="s2">boyfriend. We started with a casual</p>
<p begin="00:45:37.121" end="00:45:40.121" style="s2">hookup. I want more than something</p>
<p begin="00:45:38.321" end="00:45:41.621" style="s2">quick. So you&#39;re on a trial run? A trial</p>
<p begin="00:45:40.121" end="00:45:42.721" style="s2">run? What do I have to do to pass?</p>
<p begin="00:45:41.621" end="00:45:44.421" style="s2">First, no keeping things from me and</p>
<p begin="00:45:42.721" end="00:45:45.721" style="s2">inject</p>
<p begin="00:45:44.421" end="00:45:47.021" style="s2">first and just protect me. Second, don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:45:45.721" end="00:45:48.321" style="s2">make me angry. Third, when I tell you</p>
<p begin="00:45:47.021" end="00:45:49.121" style="s2">something, listen. Don&#39;t go and do the</p>
<p begin="00:45:48.321" end="00:45:50.921" style="s2">opposite.</p>
<p begin="00:45:49.121" end="00:45:52.721" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right. Your rules.</p>
<p begin="00:45:50.921" end="00:45:54.021" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then tell me something. Victoria said</p>
<p begin="00:45:52.721" end="00:45:55.421" style="s2">you canceled a trip with Luca to meet</p>
<p begin="00:45:54.021" end="00:45:56.021" style="s2">me. Did you already know who I was? Did</p>
<p begin="00:45:55.421" end="00:45:57.521" style="s2">you already want me?</p>
<p begin="00:45:56.021" end="00:46:00.021" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:45:57.521" end="00:46:02.721" style="s2">I recognized your voice on the app.</p>
<p begin="00:46:00.021" end="00:46:04.821" style="s2">I came because it was you.</p>
<p begin="00:46:02.721" end="00:46:06.821" style="s2">You knew the whole time and I thought I</p>
<p begin="00:46:04.821" end="00:46:10.221" style="s2">was the one getting lucky.</p>
<p begin="00:46:06.821" end="00:46:10.221" style="s2">Someone&#39;s over there. Come on.</p>
<p begin="00:46:10.721" end="00:46:13.221" style="s2">Careful.</p>
<p begin="00:46:16.521" end="00:46:20.121" style="s2">A reporter photographed Damon with some</p>
<p begin="00:46:18.121" end="00:46:22.321" style="s2">guy last night. Now people are saying he</p>
<p begin="00:46:20.121" end="00:46:24.321" style="s2">has a secret boyfriend.</p>
<p begin="00:46:22.321" end="00:46:25.421" style="s2">Hang on. That guy was kind of built like</p>
<p begin="00:46:24.321" end="00:46:27.221" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="00:46:25.421" end="00:46:30.021" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;ve got the wrong guy.</p>
<p begin="00:46:27.221" end="00:46:30.021" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t think I do.</p>
<p begin="00:46:31.921" end="00:46:35.321" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We verified the full recording. Damon</p>
<p begin="00:46:33.721" end="00:46:36.921" style="s2">Cole refused the payment. The clip was</p>
<p begin="00:46:35.321" end="00:46:38.221" style="s2">edited to make it look otherwise. Peter</p>
<p begin="00:46:36.921" end="00:46:39.502" style="s2">Ward has withdrawn the allegation and</p>
<p begin="00:46:38.221" end="00:46:41.522" style="s2">lifted his suspension.</p>
<p begin="00:46:39.502" end="00:46:41.522" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:46:46.421" end="00:46:49.521" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I knew he hadn&#39;t done it.</p>
<p begin="00:46:48.017" end="00:46:51.321" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:46:49.521" end="00:46:53.121" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s the man I want coaching this</p>
<p begin="00:46:51.321" end="00:46:54.521" style="s2">team. Good thing they checked. They</p>
<p begin="00:46:53.121" end="00:46:55.021" style="s2">nearly destroyed a good coach over a</p>
<p begin="00:46:54.521" end="00:46:56.121" style="s2">lie.</p>
<p begin="00:46:55.021" end="00:46:57.521" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Exactly.</p>
<p begin="00:46:56.121" end="00:46:57.723" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The recording cleared you, but we&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:46:57.521" end="00:46:59.422" style="s2">still</p>
<p begin="00:46:57.723" end="00:47:01.122" style="s2">&gt;&gt; looking for the men behind this. Be</p>
<p begin="00:46:59.422" end="00:47:01.823" style="s2">careful,</p>
<p begin="00:47:01.122" end="00:47:04.922" style="s2">Be careful.</p>
<p begin="00:47:01.823" end="00:47:04.922" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I will. Thank you.</p>
<p begin="00:47:06.023" end="00:47:09.922" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So you have to keep your distance again.</p>
<p begin="00:47:08.523" end="00:47:10.622" style="s2">You&#39;ve only just got someone in your</p>
<p begin="00:47:09.922" end="00:47:13.223" style="s2">life.</p>
<p begin="00:47:10.622" end="00:47:16.323" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No. This time I&#39;m staying by his side.</p>
<p begin="00:47:13.223" end="00:47:16.323" style="s2">That&#39;s where I&#39;ll protect him.</p>
<p begin="00:47:16.837" end="00:47:18.857" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:47:20.223" end="00:47:23.823" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Congratulations, coach. Your name&#39;s been</p>
<p begin="00:47:22.323" end="00:47:26.323" style="s2">cleared and you&#39;re back where you</p>
<p begin="00:47:23.823" end="00:47:26.323" style="s2">belong.</p>
<p begin="00:47:27.823" end="00:47:29.823" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you. No one&#39;s ever given me</p>
<p begin="00:47:29.023" end="00:47:32.223" style="s2">flowers before.</p>
<p begin="00:47:29.823" end="00:47:33.323" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Seriously? Actually, that makes sense.</p>
<p begin="00:47:32.223" end="00:47:34.223" style="s2">You look so strict. Your players</p>
<p begin="00:47:33.323" end="00:47:34.622" style="s2">probably wouldn&#39;t dare bring you</p>
<p begin="00:47:34.223" end="00:47:36.323" style="s2">flowers.</p>
<p begin="00:47:34.622" end="00:47:37.797" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then let me thank you properly. I have</p>
<p begin="00:47:36.323" end="00:47:39.523" style="s2">something for you too.</p>
<p begin="00:47:37.797" end="00:47:41.323" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:47:39.523" end="00:47:43.523" style="s2">What&#39;s this? I found it while I was</p>
<p begin="00:47:41.323" end="00:47:44.823" style="s2">packing last night. I kept the ticket</p>
<p begin="00:47:43.523" end="00:47:47.122" style="s2">and had it framed for you.</p>
<p begin="00:47:44.823" end="00:47:49.622" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Noah Morgan, your first home start, I</p>
<p begin="00:47:47.122" end="00:47:49.622" style="s2">was there.</p>
<p begin="00:47:50.323" end="00:47:54.122" style="s2">At game</p>
<p begin="00:47:51.723" end="00:47:55.483" style="s2">I kept looking at the stands.</p>
<p begin="00:47:54.122" end="00:47:57.422" style="s2">I thought no one had come for me.</p>
<p begin="00:47:55.483" end="00:47:59.823" style="s2">[music] I came for Noah Morgan, not the</p>
<p begin="00:47:57.422" end="00:48:01.422" style="s2">score. So you were there for me?</p>
<p begin="00:47:59.823" end="00:48:04.023" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Noah, I spent my whole career watching</p>
<p begin="00:48:01.422" end="00:48:05.422" style="s2">games. I never looked for signs in them.</p>
<p begin="00:48:04.023" end="00:48:07.223" style="s2">But when I found your name beside that</p>
<p begin="00:48:05.422" end="00:48:09.893" style="s2">date, all I could think about was you.</p>
<p begin="00:48:07.223" end="00:48:12.723" style="s2">It made me even more certain.</p>
<p begin="00:48:09.893" end="00:48:14.823" style="s2">[music] You&#39;re the only man I want.</p>
<p begin="00:48:12.723" end="00:48:16.223" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Did this hotel spend all its money on</p>
<p begin="00:48:14.823" end="00:48:19.122" style="s2">the lobby?</p>
<p begin="00:48:16.223" end="00:48:21.028" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah. Damon, you got your job back. I</p>
<p begin="00:48:19.122" end="00:48:23.048" style="s2">brought something to celebrate.</p>
<p begin="00:48:21.028" end="00:48:23.048" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:48:24.723" end="00:48:28.122" style="s2">Look at you, always acting like nobody</p>
<p begin="00:48:26.422" end="00:48:29.523" style="s2">could tempt you. You get your job back</p>
<p begin="00:48:28.122" end="00:48:32.422" style="s2">and you&#39;re already testing the bed.</p>
<p begin="00:48:29.523" end="00:48:32.422" style="s2">Sounds like it&#39;s losing.</p>
<p begin="00:48:34.122" end="00:48:36.723" style="s2">I&#39;ll get you a better mattress next</p>
<p begin="00:48:35.223" end="00:48:38.723" style="s2">time. Hockey players have strong backs,</p>
<p begin="00:48:36.723" end="00:48:41.323" style="s2">but the equipment still has to keep up.</p>
<p begin="00:48:38.723" end="00:48:41.323" style="s2">Carry on.</p>
<p begin="00:48:45.422" end="00:48:49.523" style="s2">Is your back still stiff from all that</p>
<p begin="00:48:46.723" end="00:48:51.023" style="s2">sitting? Let me loosen it up. Relax. I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:48:49.523" end="00:48:52.468" style="s2">good at this. I can make you feel</p>
<p begin="00:48:51.023" end="00:48:55.023" style="s2">better.</p>
<p begin="00:48:52.468" end="00:48:57.323" style="s2">[snorts] Does he hear how that sounds?</p>
<p begin="00:48:55.023" end="00:48:59.622" style="s2">Want to try, coach?</p>
<p begin="00:48:57.323" end="00:48:59.622" style="s2">Sit.</p>
<p begin="00:49:02.124" end="00:49:05.224" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where did you learn this?</p>
<p begin="00:49:03.424" end="00:49:07.024" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom used to run a massage studio. I</p>
<p begin="00:49:05.224" end="00:49:09.624" style="s2">picked up a few things. When she was</p>
<p begin="00:49:07.024" end="00:49:11.124" style="s2">busy, I&#39;d help out.</p>
<p begin="00:49:09.624" end="00:49:12.524" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That explains it.</p>
<p begin="00:49:11.124" end="00:49:14.924" style="s2">Well, coach?</p>
<p begin="00:49:12.524" end="00:49:16.124" style="s2">Not bad, right?</p>
<p begin="00:49:14.924" end="00:49:17.224" style="s2">Very good.</p>
<p begin="00:49:16.124" end="00:49:20.324" style="s2">Hold still.</p>
<p begin="00:49:17.224" end="00:49:20.324" style="s2">This part might hurt a little.</p>
<p begin="00:49:24.924" end="00:49:28.124" style="s2">That&#39;s enough. I&#39;m good.</p>
<p begin="00:49:28.624" end="00:49:33.724" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not yet. I haven&#39;t done this side.</p>
<p begin="00:49:30.524" end="00:49:33.724" style="s2">Relax. I&#39;ve got it.</p>
<p begin="00:49:34.524" end="00:49:38.319" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Well, what? Tell me that wasn&#39;t worth 10</p>
<p begin="00:49:36.824" end="00:49:39.524" style="s2">bucks.</p>
<p begin="00:49:38.319" end="00:49:44.124" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:49:39.524" end="00:49:45.624" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Worth every cent. Obviously. Better?</p>
<p begin="00:49:44.124" end="00:49:47.489" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll take you home, then head out for</p>
<p begin="00:49:45.624" end="00:49:48.524" style="s2">the scouting work.</p>
<p begin="00:49:47.489" end="00:49:51.624" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:49:48.524" end="00:49:51.624" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay. Let&#39;s go.</p>
<p begin="00:49:56.924" end="00:50:00.124" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Noah, my back&#39;s sore, and the guys have</p>
<p begin="00:49:58.724" end="00:50:01.824" style="s2">decided that tells them everything about</p>
<p begin="00:50:00.124" end="00:50:03.864" style="s2">what my body can still do. Do they think</p>
<p begin="00:50:01.824" end="00:50:05.884" style="s2">you&#39;re too old to keep up, too?</p>
<p begin="00:50:03.864" end="00:50:05.884" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:50:07.724" end="00:50:11.724" style="s2">&gt;&gt; From what happened today, men still seem</p>
<p begin="00:50:09.124" end="00:50:11.724" style="s2">interested.</p>
<p begin="00:50:12.324" end="00:50:14.824" style="s2">&gt;&gt; After the game, a guy asked me for</p>
<p begin="00:50:13.524" end="00:50:17.524" style="s2">directions, then he asked for my</p>
<p begin="00:50:14.824" end="00:50:17.524" style="s2">personal number.</p>
<p begin="00:50:17.624" end="00:50:22.524" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m guessing you didn&#39;t give it to him.</p>
<p begin="00:50:19.824" end="00:50:22.524" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Actually, I did.</p>
<p begin="00:50:23.024" end="00:50:26.124" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, really?</p>
<p begin="00:50:24.524" end="00:50:28.224" style="s2">Keeping your options open?</p>
<p begin="00:50:26.124" end="00:50:30.124" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I gave him my boyfriend&#39;s number. 4</p>
