<p begin="00:57:22.929" end="00:57:27.729" style="s2">care more about being happy than proving</p>
<p begin="00:57:24.429" end="00:57:27.729" style="s2">over and over that you deserve a place.</p>
<p begin="00:57:30.929" end="00:57:36.629" style="s2">Look at that trunk. It&#39;s beautiful.</p>
<p begin="00:57:34.029" end="00:57:39.329" style="s2">Do you mind if I take a closer look?</p>
<p begin="00:57:36.629" end="00:57:39.329" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not at all.</p>
<p begin="00:57:39.929" end="00:57:42.629" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where did you get it?</p>
<p begin="00:57:41.229" end="00:57:46.329" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Paris. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:57:42.629" end="00:57:46.329" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Paris, of course.</p>
<p begin="00:57:46.629" end="00:57:51.129" style="s2">Could you hold this for me?</p>
<p begin="00:57:49.429" end="00:57:52.729" style="s2">Lift that end a little. There you go,</p>
<p begin="00:57:51.129" end="00:57:54.929" style="s2">little. There you go. You make that look</p>
<p begin="00:57:52.729" end="00:57:57.129" style="s2">easy. That trunk&#39;s almost as big as me.</p>
<p begin="00:57:54.929" end="00:57:59.400" style="s2">You&#39;re much easier to carry.</p>
<p begin="00:57:57.129" end="00:58:01.029" style="s2">Try it now. Yoger added wire your.</p>
<p begin="00:57:59.400" end="00:58:02.529" style="s2">[music] It moves.</p>
<p begin="00:58:01.029" end="00:58:05.929" style="s2">See?</p>
<p begin="00:58:02.529" end="00:58:05.929" style="s2">Now it wants to go on its own.</p>
<p begin="00:58:06.529" end="00:58:11.900" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ve got it now. Thank you both.</p>
