<p begin="00:58:25.529" end="00:58:30.829" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do you have a first aid kit?</p>
<p begin="00:58:27.129" end="00:58:32.529" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Bottom drawer beside the sofa.</p>
<p begin="00:58:30.829" end="00:58:35.425" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good thing you keep this here. Years of</p>
<p begin="00:58:32.529" end="00:58:37.229" style="s2">hockey. I&#39;m used to having one around.</p>
<p begin="00:58:35.425" end="00:58:38.129" style="s2">[music] Let&#39;s clean it first. Let me do</p>
