<p begin="00:58:45.929" end="00:58:49.429" style="s2">There. You keep moving closer, and I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:58:48.129" end="00:58:50.729" style="s2">finding it harder to behave. Are you</p>
<p begin="00:58:49.429" end="00:58:52.529" style="s2">sure you want to keep doing that?</p>
