<p begin="00:58:52.529" end="00:58:55.729" style="s2">didn&#39;t want it to hurt.</p>
<p begin="00:58:53.729" end="00:58:57.529" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Easy. I&#39;m uncomfortable for a different</p>
<p begin="00:58:55.729" end="00:58:58.629" style="s2">reason now.</p>
