<p begin="00:58:58.629" end="00:59:01.029" style="s2">your hand.</p>
<p begin="00:58:59.660" end="00:59:03.129" style="s2">[music] I thought you knew what I was</p>
<p begin="00:59:01.029" end="00:59:04.929" style="s2">really asking for.</p>
<p begin="00:59:03.129" end="00:59:07.729" style="s2">That helped. I&#39;ll put this away.</p>
<p begin="00:59:04.929" end="00:59:07.729" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I will. I &#39;ve got it.</p>
<p begin="00:59:10.729" end="00:59:14.431" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Great. No umbrella, and now we&#39;re stuck</p>
<p begin="00:59:12.831" end="00:59:17.131" style="s2">out here.</p>
<p begin="00:59:14.431" end="00:59:17.131" style="s2">I&#39;ll get you inside.</p>
