<p begin="00:59:23.431" end="00:59:28.331" style="s2">Stay here a minute. Your shirt&#39;s soaked.</p>
<p begin="00:59:24.931" end="00:59:28.331" style="s2">Let me dry it. Take it off. Okay.</p>
<p begin="00:59:32.531" end="00:59:35.231" style="s2">What are you doing, coach? [music] If</p>
