<p begin="00:59:37.651" end="00:59:42.431" style="s2">[snorts] What are you doing? [music]</p>
<p begin="00:59:38.831" end="00:59:42.431" style="s2">I&#39;m warning you. I&#39;m not that innocent.</p>
