<p begin="00:59:53.631" end="00:59:56.331" style="s2">drying your shirt.</p>
<p begin="01:00:00.031" end="01:00:02.596" style="s2">Done. [music]</p>
<p begin="01:00:03.131" end="01:00:06.331" style="s2">That was an accident.</p>
<p begin="01:00:04.731" end="01:00:08.131" style="s2">Well, Noah,</p>
<p begin="01:00:06.331" end="01:00:11.931" style="s2">how did I feel? I said it was an</p>
<p begin="01:00:08.131" end="01:00:11.931" style="s2">accident. Fix your shirt.</p>
<p begin="01:00:13.231" end="01:00:17.831" style="s2">Is that it?</p>
