<p begin="01:00:37.931" end="01:00:40.931" style="s2">Oh God.</p>
<p begin="01:00:43.807" end="01:00:45.827" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:00:46.531" end="01:00:50.331" style="s2">I made the team.</p>
