<p begin="01:00:54.942" end="01:00:58.631" style="s2">[gasps] Didn&#39;t think you&#39;d win him over</p>
<p begin="01:00:56.531" end="01:01:00.231" style="s2">this fast.</p>
<p begin="01:00:58.631" end="01:01:02.331" style="s2">So you&#39;re [music] Shaw. What about the</p>
<p begin="01:01:00.231" end="01:01:03.831" style="s2">guy you&#39;ve been hung up on for 6 years?</p>
<p begin="01:01:02.331" end="01:01:04.631" style="s2">You still have his wristband. Drink your</p>
<p begin="01:01:03.831" end="01:01:06.131" style="s2">coffee. You don&#39;t need to know</p>
