<p begin="01:01:10.007" end="01:01:12.027" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="01:01:13.531" end="01:01:16.832" style="s2">There&#39;s already someone else. If he</p>
<p begin="01:01:15.331" end="01:01:18.032" style="s2">couldn&#39;t choose me completely me, and I</p>
<p begin="01:01:16.832" end="01:01:20.487" style="s2">actually believed him.</p>
<p begin="01:01:18.032" end="01:01:22.032" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Noah? What are you doing here? You look</p>
<p begin="01:01:20.487" end="01:01:23.762" style="s2">[snorts] awful. Have you been crying?</p>
<p begin="01:01:22.032" end="01:01:23.932" style="s2">Who upset you?</p>
