<p begin="01:01:23.932" end="01:01:26.332" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I just wanted to</p>
<p begin="01:01:25.132" end="01:01:28.932" style="s2">Nobody.</p>
<p begin="01:01:26.332" end="01:01:30.132" style="s2">I just want a minute alone.</p>
<p begin="01:01:28.932" end="01:01:31.732" style="s2">I&#39;m going to grandma&#39;s to pick something</p>
<p begin="01:01:30.132" end="01:01:34.932" style="s2">up. Come with me.</p>
<p begin="01:01:31.732" end="01:01:34.932" style="s2">We can get out of here for a while.</p>
<p begin="01:01:35.532" end="01:01:39.632" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Grandma, we&#39;re here.</p>
<p begin="01:01:37.332" end="01:01:41.732" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What brings you two out here? There&#39;s my</p>
<p begin="01:01:39.632" end="01:01:43.332" style="s2">Noah. You should have called. I would</p>
<p begin="01:01:41.732" end="01:01:44.832" style="s2">have made something you like.</p>
<p begin="01:01:43.332" end="01:01:45.632" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I missed you.</p>
<p begin="01:01:44.832" end="01:01:47.632" style="s2">So I came.</p>
<p begin="01:01:45.632" end="01:01:47.932" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Look at you. You&#39;re so pale. Staying up</p>
<p begin="01:01:47.632" end="01:01:48.832" style="s2">again?</p>
<p begin="01:01:47.932" end="01:01:49.532" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s been working too hard. A couple</p>
<p begin="01:01:48.832" end="01:01:51.032" style="s2">days here will help.</p>
