<p begin="01:01:52.932" end="01:01:54.732" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="01:01:54.547" end="01:01:57.332" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="01:01:54.732" end="01:01:57.332" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thanks, grandma.</p>
