<p begin="01:02:55.632" end="01:02:58.793" style="s2">at his grandmother&#39;s. [music]</p>
<p begin="01:03:01.332" end="01:03:05.632" style="s2">He left without telling me, won&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:03:02.532" end="01:03:08.432" style="s2">answer, and posted from the lake.</p>
<p begin="01:03:05.632" end="01:03:08.432" style="s2">Something happened.</p>
