<p begin="01:03:21.233" end="01:03:25.648" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stay outside. The door&#39;s stuck.</p>
<p begin="01:03:23.628" end="01:03:25.648" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="01:03:28.633" end="01:03:32.433" style="s2">Stay out there. I don&#39;t want you getting</p>
