<p begin="01:03:38.433" end="01:03:42.133" style="s2">What are you doing here?</p>
<p begin="01:03:40.133" end="01:03:43.833" style="s2">I came to find you. Why? Is it fun</p>
<p begin="01:03:42.133" end="01:03:47.633" style="s2">watching me believe every word you say?</p>
<p begin="01:03:43.833" end="01:03:47.633" style="s2">Does that make you feel good, Noah?</p>
<p begin="01:03:48.933" end="01:03:51.933" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Now let me look at the handsome man</p>
<p begin="01:03:50.633" end="01:03:53.333" style="s2">fixing my lights. [music]</p>
<p begin="01:03:51.933" end="01:03:54.333" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s nice to meet you. I&#39;m Noah&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:03:53.333" end="01:03:55.833" style="s2">friend.</p>
<p begin="01:03:54.333" end="01:03:56.833" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Noah&#39;s friend?</p>
<p begin="01:03:55.833" end="01:03:59.133" style="s2">Then come inside.</p>
<p begin="01:03:56.833" end="01:04:01.533" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Grandma, he has things to do. He&#39;s</p>
