<p begin="01:04:04.833" end="01:04:09.233" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, through there by the table.</p>
<p begin="01:04:06.933" end="01:04:09.233" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right.</p>
<p begin="01:04:12.833" end="01:04:15.533" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Beautiful view, isn&#39;t it? Have you</p>
<p begin="01:04:14.533" end="01:04:18.033" style="s2">eaten?</p>
<p begin="01:04:15.533" end="01:04:21.733" style="s2">Good timing. Noah hasn&#39;t eaten either.</p>
<p begin="01:04:18.033" end="01:04:21.733" style="s2">Everything&#39;s ready. I&#39;ll bring it out.</p>
<p begin="01:04:24.633" end="01:04:27.033" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you.</p>
<p begin="01:04:25.333" end="01:04:27.533" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There are honey-glazed ribs, too. I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="01:04:27.033" end="01:04:28.233" style="s2">get them.</p>
