<p begin="01:04:29.733" end="01:04:34.733" style="s2">that. He&#39;s thoughtful. Doesn&#39;t wait to</p>
<p begin="01:04:31.833" end="01:04:35.733" style="s2">be asked. I like that.</p>
<p begin="01:04:34.733" end="01:04:37.333" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sure.</p>
<p begin="01:04:35.733" end="01:04:40.333" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t give me that. He came all this</p>
<p begin="01:04:37.333" end="01:04:40.333" style="s2">way. Be kind.</p>
<p begin="01:04:40.433" end="01:04:43.833" style="s2">These are Noah&#39;s favorite, honey-glazed</p>
<p begin="01:04:42.633" end="01:04:45.633" style="s2">ribs.</p>
