<p begin="01:04:48.124" end="01:04:50.144" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="01:04:50.633" end="01:04:54.033" style="s2">Just because they sound good doesn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:04:52.133" end="01:04:54.933" style="s2">mean they&#39;re for you.</p>
<p begin="01:04:54.033" end="01:04:56.033" style="s2">Thanks, Grandma.</p>
<p begin="01:04:54.933" end="01:04:58.433" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Here.</p>
<p begin="01:04:56.033" end="01:04:58.433" style="s2">Have another.</p>
