<p begin="01:05:12.133" end="01:05:16.133" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="01:05:13.133" end="01:05:18.733" style="s2">I&#39;ve loved him for years.</p>
<p begin="01:05:16.133" end="01:05:18.733" style="s2">I&#39;m done.</p>
<p begin="01:05:19.133" end="01:05:21.233" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That boy.</p>
<p begin="01:05:20.233" end="01:05:25.035" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s happened to him?</p>
<p begin="01:05:21.233" end="01:05:27.235" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let him be. You and I will eat.</p>
<p begin="01:05:25.035" end="01:05:28.935" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He says he&#39;s loved me for years. [music]</p>
<p begin="01:05:27.235" end="01:05:31.335" style="s2">Then who&#39;s the man Ethan was talking</p>
<p begin="01:05:28.935" end="01:05:32.535" style="s2">about?</p>
<p begin="01:05:31.335" end="01:05:33.935" style="s2">Noah?</p>
<p begin="01:05:32.535" end="01:05:35.995" style="s2">Can I come in?</p>
<p begin="01:05:33.935" end="01:05:35.995" style="s2">No. [music]</p>
<p begin="01:05:39.035" end="01:05:42.035" style="s2">I said no. You&#39;ve decided I&#39;ve done</p>
<p begin="01:05:40.835" end="01:05:44.135" style="s2">something wrong, but I don&#39;t know what</p>
<p begin="01:05:42.035" end="01:05:46.135" style="s2">it is. Tell me what happened.</p>
<p begin="01:05:44.135" end="01:05:47.735" style="s2">Let me answer you. You want to know who</p>
<p begin="01:05:46.135" end="01:05:49.335" style="s2">is Ethan talking about in your suite?</p>
<p begin="01:05:47.735" end="01:05:51.660" style="s2">The man you&#39;ve wanted for six years. I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="01:05:49.335" end="01:05:52.835" style="s2">not going to be someone&#39;s replacement.</p>
<p begin="01:05:51.660" end="01:05:54.335" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="01:05:52.835" end="01:05:56.535" style="s2">So that&#39;s what this is.</p>
<p begin="01:05:54.335" end="01:05:59.735" style="s2">You heard us. Yes, I heard you. Go find</p>
<p begin="01:05:56.535" end="01:05:59.735" style="s2">him. Leave me alone.</p>
<p begin="01:06:00.235" end="01:06:03.235" style="s2">He&#39;s kind,</p>
<p begin="01:06:01.735" end="01:06:04.735" style="s2">smart. [music] He knows when someone</p>
<p begin="01:06:03.235" end="01:06:05.235" style="s2">needs help and he&#39;s good at what he</p>
<p begin="01:06:04.735" end="01:06:07.235" style="s2">does.</p>
<p begin="01:06:05.235" end="01:06:08.335" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re seriously praising another man to</p>
<p begin="01:06:07.235" end="01:06:10.935" style="s2">my face?</p>
<p begin="01:06:08.335" end="01:06:12.135" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He isn&#39;t some perfect man I dreamed up.</p>
<p begin="01:06:10.935" end="01:06:15.235" style="s2">He&#39;s the man who helped me when I</p>
<p begin="01:06:12.135" end="01:06:15.235" style="s2">couldn&#39;t help myself.</p>
<p begin="01:06:15.635" end="01:06:19.135" style="s2">Why is he looking at me like that? He</p>
<p begin="01:06:17.335" end="01:06:22.235" style="s2">can&#39;t mean I&#39;ve been terrified of being</p>
<p begin="01:06:19.135" end="01:06:25.535" style="s2">locked in the dark since I was a kid.</p>
<p begin="01:06:22.235" end="01:06:25.535" style="s2">He&#39;s been there for me twice.</p>
<p begin="01:06:25.735" end="01:06:29.335" style="s2">The first time was six years ago at a</p>
<p begin="01:06:27.635" end="01:06:32.270" style="s2">charity event here.</p>
<p begin="01:06:29.335" end="01:06:34.290" style="s2">That was the [music] first time we met.</p>
<p begin="01:06:32.270" end="01:06:34.290" style="s2">[sighs]</p>
<p begin="01:06:36.235" end="01:06:40.435" style="s2">And today he stayed with me again.</p>
<p begin="01:06:40.935" end="01:06:44.335" style="s2">Till he and your grandmother got that</p>
<p begin="01:06:42.435" end="01:06:47.435" style="s2">door open.</p>
<p begin="01:06:44.335" end="01:06:49.835" style="s2">So the man you&#39;ve been holding on to</p>
<p begin="01:06:47.435" end="01:06:49.835" style="s2">is me.</p>
<p begin="01:06:50.611" end="01:06:53.035" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="01:06:51.435" end="01:06:56.135" style="s2">Yes.</p>
<p begin="01:06:53.035" end="01:06:56.135" style="s2">It&#39;s always been you.</p>
<p begin="01:06:56.835" end="01:06:59.935" style="s2">Then why didn&#39;t you tell me sooner? I</p>
<p begin="01:06:58.635" end="01:07:01.435" style="s2">was afraid you&#39;d think I&#39;d planned</p>
<p begin="01:06:59.935" end="01:07:04.035" style="s2">everything, that it would scare you</p>
<p begin="01:07:01.435" end="01:07:06.035" style="s2">away. I wanted to take it slowly, let</p>
<p begin="01:07:04.035" end="01:07:07.135" style="s2">you know who I am now, and let you</p>
<p begin="01:07:06.035" end="01:07:09.135" style="s2">choose me.</p>
<p begin="01:07:07.135" end="01:07:11.335" style="s2">When did you recognize me again?</p>
<p begin="01:07:09.135" end="01:07:13.035" style="s2">At a fan meet and greet two years later.</p>
<p begin="01:07:11.335" end="01:07:15.235" style="s2">You asked me a question.</p>
<p begin="01:07:13.035" end="01:07:16.935" style="s2">I knew your voice.</p>
<p begin="01:07:15.235" end="01:07:18.235" style="s2">Just from my voice? You probably don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:07:16.935" end="01:07:20.335" style="s2">realize it, but you still sound the</p>
<p begin="01:07:18.235" end="01:07:23.335" style="s2">same. And your face,</p>
<p begin="01:07:20.335" end="01:07:23.335" style="s2">I could never forget it.</p>
<p begin="01:07:24.016" end="01:07:26.436" style="s2">[music] Were you already about getting</p>
<p begin="01:07:25.336" end="01:07:27.736" style="s2">me into trouble back then?</p>
<p begin="01:07:26.436" end="01:07:29.536" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Whatever you call it, I&#39;ve only wanted</p>
<p begin="01:07:27.736" end="01:07:31.536" style="s2">to build a life with you, to have you as</p>
<p begin="01:07:29.536" end="01:07:34.236" style="s2">my husband and be there for you for the</p>
<p begin="01:07:31.536" end="01:07:36.336" style="s2">rest of our lives.</p>
<p begin="01:07:34.236" end="01:07:37.936" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You like me that much? [music] Keeping</p>
<p begin="01:07:36.336" end="01:07:40.336" style="s2">you on a trial run now would be pretty</p>
<p begin="01:07:37.936" end="01:07:41.736" style="s2">cruel, wouldn&#39;t it?</p>
<p begin="01:07:40.336" end="01:07:44.236" style="s2">I can wait</p>
<p begin="01:07:41.736" end="01:07:47.136" style="s2">as long as you need.</p>
<p begin="01:07:44.236" end="01:07:48.436" style="s2">Then let&#39;s do this properly, you and me.</p>
<p begin="01:07:47.136" end="01:07:49.636" style="s2">A relationship that can become a</p>
<p begin="01:07:48.436" end="01:07:51.436" style="s2">marriage.</p>
<p begin="01:07:49.636" end="01:07:52.736" style="s2">You said you&#39;d never had a boyfriend or</p>
<p begin="01:07:51.436" end="01:07:56.036" style="s2">any flings.</p>
<p begin="01:07:52.736" end="01:07:56.036" style="s2">Want to guess what my answer would be?</p>
<p begin="01:07:56.136" end="01:08:02.006" style="s2">No guessing. Come on, guess.</p>
<p begin="01:08:00.036" end="01:08:03.436" style="s2">Your past is yours.</p>
<p begin="01:08:02.006" end="01:08:04.636" style="s2">[music] It doesn&#39;t change what I want</p>
<p begin="01:08:03.436" end="01:08:07.436" style="s2">with you now</p>
<p begin="01:08:04.636" end="01:08:08.936" style="s2">or what I want for our future.</p>
<p begin="01:08:07.436" end="01:08:10.536" style="s2">Then I&#39;ll tell you.</p>
<p begin="01:08:08.936" end="01:08:12.436" style="s2">No boyfriends,</p>
<p begin="01:08:10.536" end="01:08:15.107" style="s2">no casual hookups, [music]</p>
<p begin="01:08:12.436" end="01:08:17.127" style="s2">just four years of wanting you.</p>
<p begin="01:08:15.107" end="01:08:17.127" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="01:08:18.136" end="01:08:22.336" style="s2">Then let me spend the rest of my life</p>
<p begin="01:08:19.836" end="01:08:22.336" style="s2">with you.</p>
<p begin="01:08:23.336" end="01:08:27.552" style="s2">Where are you sleeping tonight?</p>
<p begin="01:08:25.736" end="01:08:29.572" style="s2">In here.</p>
<p begin="01:08:27.552" end="01:08:29.572" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="01:08:30.136" end="01:08:33.236" style="s2">I&#39;m worried someone might wake up</p>
<p begin="01:08:31.336" end="01:08:36.236" style="s2">tomorrow and change his mind.</p>
<p begin="01:08:33.236" end="01:08:37.336" style="s2">I&#39;m not that kind of guy.</p>
<p begin="01:08:36.236" end="01:08:39.336" style="s2">I know.</p>
<p begin="01:08:37.336" end="01:08:41.036" style="s2">I&#39;m still worried.</p>
<p begin="01:08:39.336" end="01:08:44.136" style="s2">I&#39;ll take the floor. I won&#39;t cross the</p>
<p begin="01:08:41.036" end="01:08:44.136" style="s2">line. I promise.</p>
<p begin="01:08:47.836" end="01:08:51.536" style="s2">Damon, are you asleep?</p>
<p begin="01:08:49.736" end="01:08:53.136" style="s2">I can&#39;t sleep either.</p>
<p begin="01:08:51.536" end="01:08:55.636" style="s2">Yes, I have. Thank you for giving us a</p>
<p begin="01:08:53.136" end="01:08:55.636" style="s2">chance.</p>
<p begin="01:08:57.736" end="01:09:01.336" style="s2">Damon, I don&#39;t want to wait anymore.</p>
<p begin="01:09:07.636" end="01:09:10.436" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Up early, aren&#39;t you?</p>
<p begin="01:09:09.536" end="01:09:12.236" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Morning.</p>
<p begin="01:09:10.436" end="01:09:15.336" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yesterday you could barely look at each</p>
<p begin="01:09:12.236" end="01:09:17.336" style="s2">other. Today, everything&#39;s fine?</p>
<p begin="01:09:15.336" end="01:09:19.136" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I hadn&#39;t done enough before,</p>
<p begin="01:09:17.336" end="01:09:20.136" style="s2">but today</p>
<p begin="01:09:19.136" end="01:09:21.636" style="s2">I passed the trial.</p>
<p begin="01:09:20.136" end="01:09:22.836" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You passed? Wonderful. When&#39;s the</p>
<p begin="01:09:21.636" end="01:09:24.536" style="s2">wedding then? I need time to get</p>
<p begin="01:09:22.836" end="01:09:26.438" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Grandma, we only just made it official.</p>
<p begin="01:09:24.536" end="01:09:27.838" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So, your grandfather and I married less</p>
<p begin="01:09:26.438" end="01:09:28.938" style="s2">&gt;&gt; than a month after we met. We had more</p>
<p begin="01:09:27.838" end="01:09:30.538" style="s2">than 50 years together.</p>
<p begin="01:09:28.938" end="01:09:30.737" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She has a point. I&#39;ll keep working on</p>
<p begin="01:09:30.538" end="01:09:31.737" style="s2">it.</p>
<p begin="01:09:30.737" end="01:09:35.438" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Working on what?</p>
<p begin="01:09:31.737" end="01:09:35.438" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I like you. Don&#39;t let me down.</p>
<p begin="01:09:41.567" end="01:09:44.538" style="s2">[music] We&#39;re off.</p>
<p begin="01:09:45.237" end="01:09:49.137" style="s2">Lucky, I think your grandmother likes</p>
<p begin="01:09:46.737" end="01:09:51.338" style="s2">me. She&#39;s my grandmother. Soon she&#39;ll be</p>
<p begin="01:09:49.137" end="01:09:54.038" style="s2">mine, too.</p>
<p begin="01:09:51.338" end="01:09:56.338" style="s2">Do you think we&#39;re moving too fast?</p>
<p begin="01:09:54.038" end="01:09:58.738" style="s2">Because it feels slow to me.</p>
<p begin="01:09:56.338" end="01:10:00.563" style="s2">I&#39;ve waited six years for this. [music]</p>
<p begin="01:09:58.738" end="01:10:02.583" style="s2">I want all those days back with you.</p>
<p begin="01:10:00.563" end="01:10:02.583" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:10:03.838" end="01:10:05.858" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="01:10:06.538" end="01:10:09.338" style="s2">Camera team.</p>
<p begin="01:10:07.738" end="01:10:10.738" style="s2">Here.</p>
<p begin="01:10:09.338" end="01:10:12.137" style="s2">Eli Morgan.</p>
<p begin="01:10:10.738" end="01:10:15.338" style="s2">Where&#39;s Eli?</p>
<p begin="01:10:12.137" end="01:10:15.338" style="s2">Here. Sorry.</p>
<p begin="01:10:15.738" end="01:10:18.438" style="s2">If you&#39;re late again.</p>
<p begin="01:10:17.038" end="01:10:21.137" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It was a one-off. I promise it won&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:10:18.438" end="01:10:21.137" style="s2">happen again.</p>
<p begin="01:10:23.637" end="01:10:28.938" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Noah, why are you hiding under that hat?</p>
<p begin="01:10:26.438" end="01:10:30.038" style="s2">Why are you late? Because of you. I got</p>
<p begin="01:10:28.938" end="01:10:31.538" style="s2">the call about this and went to</p>
<p begin="01:10:30.038" end="01:10:32.838" style="s2">grandma&#39;s to get you. You&#39;d already</p>
<p begin="01:10:31.538" end="01:10:34.938" style="s2">left. I wouldn&#39;t be late if I hadn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:10:32.838" end="01:10:36.637" style="s2">gone looking for you. 50 bucks for the</p>
<p begin="01:10:34.938" end="01:10:37.838" style="s2">emotional damage.</p>
<p begin="01:10:36.637" end="01:10:39.538" style="s2">No money.</p>
<p begin="01:10:37.838" end="01:10:41.938" style="s2">I&#39;ll buy you dinner.</p>
<p begin="01:10:39.538" end="01:10:41.938" style="s2">Deal.</p>
<p begin="01:10:43.338" end="01:10:47.038" style="s2">The man in the cap, stand up.</p>
<p begin="01:10:47.738" end="01:10:51.738" style="s2">Third drill on today&#39;s sheet. Read it</p>
<p begin="01:10:49.538" end="01:10:51.738" style="s2">out.</p>
<p begin="01:10:53.137" end="01:10:56.038" style="s2">When we lose the puck, the nearest</p>
<p begin="01:10:54.438" end="01:10:57.538" style="s2">player pressures the puck carrier. The</p>
<p begin="01:10:56.038" end="01:10:59.137" style="s2">others move back, cover the passing</p>
<p begin="01:10:57.538" end="01:11:00.823" style="s2">lanes, and protect the middle.</p>
<p begin="01:10:59.137" end="01:11:02.038" style="s2">Eli.</p>
<p begin="01:11:00.823" end="01:11:03.438" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="01:11:02.038" end="01:11:04.738" style="s2">Here. What movement did he just</p>
<p begin="01:11:03.438" end="01:11:07.238" style="s2">describe? What do you need to keep in</p>
<p begin="01:11:04.738" end="01:11:07.238" style="s2">the shot?</p>
<p begin="01:11:09.137" end="01:11:12.038" style="s2">I missed that part. Stand by the camera</p>
<p begin="01:11:10.838" end="01:11:14.538" style="s2">at the back. It might help you stay</p>
<p begin="01:11:12.038" end="01:11:14.538" style="s2">focused.</p>
<p begin="01:11:15.238" end="01:11:17.738" style="s2">You can sit.</p>
<p begin="01:11:18.538" end="01:11:22.038" style="s2">Come to my office when we&#39;re finished.</p>
<p begin="01:11:30.438" end="01:11:33.339" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I I we were going to your office. Why</p>
<p begin="01:11:32.039" end="01:11:35.239" style="s2">are we out here?</p>
<p begin="01:11:33.339" end="01:11:37.739" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Next time I&#39;m talking, stop looking at</p>
<p begin="01:11:35.239" end="01:11:38.939" style="s2">Eli. Look at me.</p>
<p begin="01:11:37.739" end="01:11:40.739" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s my brother. [music]</p>
<p begin="01:11:38.939" end="01:11:42.039" style="s2">You&#39;re seriously jealous of him?</p>
<p begin="01:11:40.739" end="01:11:43.939" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The only person I promised not to</p>
<p begin="01:11:42.039" end="01:11:45.939" style="s2">compete with is your</p>
<p begin="01:11:43.939" end="01:11:47.839" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Party&#39;s over and coach Cole&#39;s still</p>
<p begin="01:11:45.939" end="01:11:49.294" style="s2">here. This one&#39;s going in the family</p>
<p begin="01:11:47.839" end="01:11:51.314" style="s2">chat.</p>
<p begin="01:11:49.294" end="01:11:51.314" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="01:11:51.439" end="01:11:54.534" style="s2">Wolf celebration who made it to my</p>
<p begin="01:11:53.039" end="01:11:56.554" style="s2">video.</p>
<p begin="01:11:54.534" end="01:11:56.554" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="01:11:59.439" end="01:12:03.239" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wait, is coach Cole kissing Noah</p>
<p begin="01:12:02.339" end="01:12:04.339" style="s2">We&#39;re sitting right there. I thought</p>
<p begin="01:12:03.239" end="01:12:05.539" style="s2">they were just talking about training.</p>
<p begin="01:12:04.339" end="01:12:08.289" style="s2">It&#39;s Noah Morgan. He just made the</p>
<p begin="01:12:05.539" end="01:12:10.309" style="s2">roster. He&#39;s lucky from Velvet, too.</p>
<p begin="01:12:08.289" end="01:12:10.309" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="01:12:11.739" end="01:12:16.339" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No way.</p>
<p begin="01:12:12.939" end="01:12:16.339" style="s2">Coach&#39;s boyfriend is my brother?</p>
<p begin="01:12:27.839" end="01:12:31.339" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hello?</p>
<p begin="01:12:29.639" end="01:12:33.835" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I hear you&#39;re dating your coach. Come</p>
<p begin="01:12:31.339" end="01:12:35.855" style="s2">home right now.</p>
<p begin="01:12:33.835" end="01:12:35.855" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="01:12:43.939" end="01:12:46.639" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m going in with you.</p>
<p begin="01:12:48.039" end="01:12:50.739" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Noah, I&#39;m scared to go in. After what</p>
<p begin="01:12:49.539" end="01:12:52.739" style="s2">mom said last time, I&#39;m afraid this will</p>
<p begin="01:12:50.739" end="01:12:54.439" style="s2">make her even angrier.</p>
<p begin="01:12:52.739" end="01:12:55.739" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We can&#39;t settle this from out here.</p>
<p begin="01:12:54.439" end="01:12:57.239" style="s2">Whatever she says, you won&#39;t be standing</p>
<p begin="01:12:55.739" end="01:13:00.439" style="s2">there alone.</p>
<p begin="01:12:57.239" end="01:13:00.439" style="s2">We&#39;ll take it one thing at a time.</p>
<p begin="01:13:01.039" end="01:13:02.939" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But</p>
<p begin="01:13:01.739" end="01:13:04.739" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What happened to her is too much for you</p>
<p begin="01:13:02.939" end="01:13:06.539" style="s2">to carry alone. Hiding won&#39;t make her</p>
<p begin="01:13:04.739" end="01:13:09.339" style="s2">less afraid. Let&#39;s talk to her. I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="01:13:06.539" end="01:13:09.339" style="s2">staying beside you.</p>
<p begin="01:13:15.100" end="01:13:18.439" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [panting]</p>
<p begin="01:13:16.139" end="01:13:18.439" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom?</p>
<p begin="01:13:19.539" end="01:13:23.439" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Claire, I&#39;m sorry to come without</p>
<p begin="01:13:21.039" end="01:13:23.439" style="s2">asking.</p>
<p begin="01:13:23.739" end="01:13:27.239" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then why did you? Who told you to bring</p>
<p begin="01:13:25.439" end="01:13:28.439" style="s2">him here? You hid this from me, Noah,</p>
<p begin="01:13:27.239" end="01:13:30.539" style="s2">and you chose another man whose whole</p>
<p begin="01:13:28.439" end="01:13:31.040" style="s2">life is hockey just like your father.</p>
<p begin="01:13:30.539" end="01:13:31.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, that&#39;s not</p>
<p begin="01:13:31.040" end="01:13:34.540" style="s2">&gt;&gt; what this is.</p>
<p begin="01:13:31.840" end="01:13:36.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Get out. Get out of my house.</p>
<p begin="01:13:34.540" end="01:13:38.940" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom.</p>
<p begin="01:13:36.640" end="01:13:38.940" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Out.</p>
<p begin="01:13:39.640" end="01:13:42.240" style="s2">Haven&#39;t you seen enough of what I went</p>
<p begin="01:13:41.140" end="01:13:43.740" style="s2">through?</p>
<p begin="01:13:42.240" end="01:13:46.340" style="s2">want the same thing to happen to you?</p>
<p begin="01:13:43.740" end="01:13:48.340" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Noah, I&#39;ve heard this for 20 years.</p>
<p begin="01:13:46.340" end="01:13:50.440" style="s2">Men cheat, men leave, men abandon their</p>
<p begin="01:13:48.340" end="01:13:51.740" style="s2">families. But why does your fear get to</p>
<p begin="01:13:50.440" end="01:13:53.540" style="s2">decide my whole life?</p>
<p begin="01:13:51.740" end="01:13:54.940" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m protecting you. I won&#39;t watch you</p>
<p begin="01:13:53.540" end="01:13:55.740" style="s2">throw his life away on a man who can</p>
<p begin="01:13:54.940" end="01:13:57.640" style="s2">hurt you like that.</p>
<p begin="01:13:55.740" end="01:13:59.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That isn&#39;t protection. It&#39;s control. I</p>
<p begin="01:13:57.640" end="01:14:00.740" style="s2">grew up feeling guilty for even liking a</p>
<p begin="01:13:59.240" end="01:14:02.540" style="s2">guy. I couldn&#39;t tell someone I wanted</p>
<p begin="01:14:00.740" end="01:14:03.940" style="s2">him without feeling afraid.</p>
<p begin="01:14:02.540" end="01:14:06.540" style="s2">Is that what keeping me safe is supposed</p>
<p begin="01:14:03.940" end="01:14:06.540" style="s2">to feel like?</p>
<p begin="01:14:06.940" end="01:14:12.040" style="s2">Noah, not every man is Richard Bennett.</p>
<p begin="01:14:09.840" end="01:14:14.040" style="s2">Damon isn&#39;t going to do what he did.</p>
<p begin="01:14:12.040" end="01:14:16.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How can you promise that?</p>
<p begin="01:14:14.040" end="01:14:18.340" style="s2">Because he wants you now? You think that</p>
<p begin="01:14:16.440" end="01:14:21.340" style="s2">means he&#39;ll treat you well forever?</p>
<p begin="01:14:18.340" end="01:14:21.340" style="s2">Don&#39;t be naive.</p>
<p begin="01:14:22.040" end="01:14:24.740" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, there has to be more to our lives</p>
<p begin="01:14:23.440" end="01:14:26.540" style="s2">than controlling everything and hating</p>
<p begin="01:14:24.740" end="01:14:28.940" style="s2">what happened.</p>
<p begin="01:14:26.540" end="01:14:31.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t care. He&#39;s your coach. I won&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:14:28.940" end="01:14:33.740" style="s2">accept this.</p>
<p begin="01:14:31.240" end="01:14:33.740" style="s2">End it.</p>
<p begin="01:14:42.840" end="01:14:46.340" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m sorry.</p>
<p begin="01:14:44.140" end="01:14:47.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You don&#39;t have to apologize.</p>
<p begin="01:14:46.340" end="01:14:50.076" style="s2">I haven&#39;t given her enough reason to</p>
<p begin="01:14:47.440" end="01:14:50.640" style="s2">trust me yet.</p>
<p begin="01:14:50.076" end="01:14:53.351" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:14:50.640" end="01:14:55.371" style="s2">Noah, your shoulder.</p>
<p begin="01:14:53.351" end="01:14:55.371" style="s2">[panting and sighs]</p>
<p begin="01:14:56.140" end="01:14:58.592" style="s2">Come on.</p>
<p begin="01:14:57.140" end="01:15:00.612" style="s2">We&#39;re getting it checked.</p>
<p begin="01:14:58.592" end="01:15:00.612" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [panting]</p>
<p begin="01:15:04.240" end="01:15:06.540" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Noah, what happened? Why are you in the</p>
<p begin="01:15:05.540" end="01:15:08.417" style="s2">hospital?</p>
<p begin="01:15:06.540" end="01:15:10.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s hurt three times this month.</p>
<p begin="01:15:08.417" end="01:15:12.240" style="s2">[snorts] What if I&#39;ve damaged it again?</p>
<p begin="01:15:10.440" end="01:15:13.540" style="s2">What if it&#39;s like it was in college?</p>
<p begin="01:15:12.240" end="01:15:14.740" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t decide that before they&#39;ve</p>
<p begin="01:15:13.540" end="01:15:18.040" style="s2">checked.</p>
<p begin="01:15:14.740" end="01:15:18.040" style="s2">You&#39;ve been under a lot of stress.</p>
<p begin="01:15:18.540" end="01:15:23.740" style="s2">Put that down for a minute.</p>
<p begin="01:15:21.040" end="01:15:23.740" style="s2">Where&#39;s Damon?</p>
<p begin="01:15:24.140" end="01:15:27.140" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What if I can&#39;t play anymore?</p>
<p begin="01:15:25.740" end="01:15:28.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Pain doesn&#39;t tell us that. We need the</p>
<p begin="01:15:27.140" end="01:15:30.940" style="s2">results.</p>
<p begin="01:15:28.440" end="01:15:32.740" style="s2">Don&#39;t jump straight to the worst answer.</p>
<p begin="01:15:30.940" end="01:15:34.442" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You don&#39;t understand. In college, I</p>
<p begin="01:15:32.740" end="01:15:35.942" style="s2">spent months recovering. I couldn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:15:34.442" end="01:15:37.442" style="s2">train, couldn&#39;t play, couldn&#39;t even lift</p>
<p begin="01:15:35.942" end="01:15:38.942" style="s2">my arm properly.</p>
<p begin="01:15:37.442" end="01:15:39.942" style="s2">It got better,</p>
<p begin="01:15:38.942" end="01:15:42.342" style="s2">but that doesn&#39;t mean the injury</p>
<p begin="01:15:39.942" end="01:15:43.842" style="s2">disappeared.</p>
<p begin="01:15:42.342" end="01:15:45.342" style="s2">If the results are bad, we should end</p>
<p begin="01:15:43.842" end="01:15:48.542" style="s2">this. I don&#39;t want you losing your job</p>
<p begin="01:15:45.342" end="01:15:48.542" style="s2">for someone who can&#39;t even play.</p>
<p begin="01:15:52.342" end="01:15:55.942" style="s2">If it&#39;s bad,</p>
<p begin="01:15:53.542" end="01:15:57.742" style="s2">we should break up.</p>
<p begin="01:15:55.942" end="01:15:59.042" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="01:15:57.742" end="01:16:00.342" style="s2">You don&#39;t get to end our future over</p>
<p begin="01:15:59.042" end="01:16:02.942" style="s2">something you&#39;re afraid might happen.</p>
<p begin="01:16:00.342" end="01:16:04.142" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;ve seen my family. Now this.</p>
<p begin="01:16:02.942" end="01:16:05.842" style="s2">I don&#39;t want to hold you back.</p>
<p begin="01:16:04.142" end="01:16:06.742" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stop, Noah. You&#39;re treating a fear like</p>
<p begin="01:16:05.842" end="01:16:08.642" style="s2">it&#39;s already a fact.</p>
<p begin="01:16:06.742" end="01:16:09.942" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You know I wanted you back in college.</p>
<p begin="01:16:08.642" end="01:16:11.042" style="s2">You don&#39;t know how afraid I was to want</p>
<p begin="01:16:09.942" end="01:16:12.342" style="s2">that much.</p>
<p begin="01:16:11.042" end="01:16:14.342" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We don&#39;t have to do this right now.</p>
<p begin="01:16:12.342" end="01:16:16.242" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I need to. If I can&#39;t keep playing,</p>
<p begin="01:16:14.342" end="01:16:18.642" style="s2">don&#39;t throw away your work for me. Eat</p>
<p begin="01:16:16.242" end="01:16:22.342" style="s2">properly, get some sleep. Don&#39;t make</p>
<p begin="01:16:18.642" end="01:16:22.342" style="s2">your whole life about looking after me.</p>
<p begin="01:16:22.842" end="01:16:25.842" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m not leaving you.</p>
<p begin="01:16:24.342" end="01:16:28.442" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;ve already given up playing.</p>
<p begin="01:16:25.842" end="01:16:29.942" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And what I do with my work is my choice.</p>
<p begin="01:16:28.442" end="01:16:31.342" style="s2">It isn&#39;t a debt you owe me.</p>
<p begin="01:16:29.942" end="01:16:33.142" style="s2">&gt;&gt; When I walked into that hotel and saw</p>
<p begin="01:16:31.342" end="01:16:34.542" style="s2">you, I was so happy. Then I got scared.</p>
<p begin="01:16:33.142" end="01:16:35.942" style="s2">What if you didn&#39;t want me? What if I</p>
<p begin="01:16:34.542" end="01:16:37.142" style="s2">wasn&#39;t enough?</p>
<p begin="01:16:35.942" end="01:16:38.242" style="s2">I tried to act like it meant nothing,</p>
<p begin="01:16:37.142" end="01:16:40.242" style="s2">but I couldn&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="01:16:38.242" end="01:16:41.542" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You were never not enough.</p>
<p begin="01:16:40.242" end="01:16:42.442" style="s2">I was the one trying everything I could</p>
<p begin="01:16:41.542" end="01:16:43.942" style="s2">to be with you.</p>
<p begin="01:16:42.442" end="01:16:45.542" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Whatever the results say, we face them</p>
<p begin="01:16:43.942" end="01:16:47.942" style="s2">together. The good parts and the hard</p>
<p begin="01:16:45.542" end="01:16:50.242" style="s2">parts. All of it.</p>
<p begin="01:16:47.942" end="01:16:50.242" style="s2">Okay?</p>
<p begin="01:16:50.842" end="01:16:55.183" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Noah Morgan?</p>
<p begin="01:16:53.342" end="01:16:56.442" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Here.</p>
<p begin="01:16:55.183" end="01:16:57.942" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [panting]</p>
<p begin="01:16:56.442" end="01:17:00.142" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re Noah?</p>
<p begin="01:16:57.942" end="01:17:01.542" style="s2">The doctor has reviewed your results.</p>
<p begin="01:17:00.142" end="01:17:02.742" style="s2">They don&#39;t show the new serious damage</p>
<p begin="01:17:01.542" end="01:17:04.342" style="s2">you were worried about. You&#39;ll need</p>
<p begin="01:17:02.742" end="01:17:06.742" style="s2">treatment, rest, and a follow-up before</p>
<p begin="01:17:04.342" end="01:17:07.942" style="s2">returning to full training.</p>
<p begin="01:17:06.742" end="01:17:09.642" style="s2">Your previous shoulder injury still</p>
<p begin="01:17:07.942" end="01:17:11.242" style="s2">matters. Follow the recovery plan and</p>
<p begin="01:17:09.642" end="01:17:13.542" style="s2">don&#39;t push through the pain. For now,</p>
<p begin="01:17:11.242" end="01:17:15.942" style="s2">focus on getting it settled.</p>
<p begin="01:17:13.542" end="01:17:15.942" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you.</p>
<p begin="01:17:17.442" end="01:17:20.342" style="s2">See?</p>
<p begin="01:17:18.442" end="01:17:21.642" style="s2">It wasn&#39;t the answer you were imagining.</p>
<p begin="01:17:20.342" end="01:17:24.342" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You two are more exhausting than a</p>
<p begin="01:17:21.642" end="01:17:24.342" style="s2">roller coaster.</p>
<p begin="01:17:24.842" end="01:17:28.142" style="s2">Okay, I&#39;m going home.</p>
<p begin="01:17:26.742" end="01:17:30.242" style="s2">Take a breath. You can work through</p>
<p begin="01:17:28.142" end="01:17:31.942" style="s2">this.</p>
<p begin="01:17:30.242" end="01:17:34.142" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re okay?</p>
<p begin="01:17:31.942" end="01:17:34.142" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah.</p>
<p begin="01:17:34.542" end="01:17:37.843" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No more offering to leave every time</p>
<p begin="01:17:35.843" end="01:17:38.743" style="s2">you&#39;re scared. If you&#39;re hurt, we get</p>
<p begin="01:17:37.843" end="01:17:41.843" style="s2">help.</p>
<p begin="01:17:38.743" end="01:17:43.643" style="s2">If there&#39;s a problem, we deal with it.</p>
<p begin="01:17:41.843" end="01:17:46.943" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay.</p>
<p begin="01:17:43.643" end="01:17:46.943" style="s2">I work on things with your mother.</p>
<p begin="01:17:52.743" end="01:17:55.543" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Getting you comfortable and following</p>
<p begin="01:17:53.743" end="01:17:57.343" style="s2">that recovery plan comes first now. I</p>
<p begin="01:17:55.543" end="01:17:58.943" style="s2">want you rested, fed, and feeling like</p>
<p begin="01:17:57.343" end="01:18:00.043" style="s2">yourself again.</p>
<p begin="01:17:58.943" end="01:18:01.543" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Got it, coach.</p>
<p begin="01:18:00.043" end="01:18:03.743" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You should eat, too.</p>
<p begin="01:18:01.543" end="01:18:05.443" style="s2">You had less than I have.</p>
<p begin="01:18:03.743" end="01:18:07.043" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s not going to work.</p>
<p begin="01:18:05.443" end="01:18:10.143" style="s2">I&#39;m not as active as I used to be. I</p>
<p begin="01:18:07.043" end="01:18:10.143" style="s2">still watch how much I eat.</p>
<p begin="01:18:11.743" end="01:18:14.043" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Relax.</p>
<p begin="01:18:12.743" end="01:18:16.743" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Even if you get round enough to roll,</p>
<p begin="01:18:14.043" end="01:18:18.143" style="s2">I&#39;m not rolling you out of my life.</p>
<p begin="01:18:16.743" end="01:18:21.443" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So now you can imagine an outcome</p>
<p begin="01:18:18.143" end="01:18:21.443" style="s2">without making it a disaster.</p>
<p begin="01:18:21.543" end="01:18:24.643" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t use that against me.</p>
<p begin="01:18:23.243" end="01:18:26.843" style="s2">I panicked. I couldn&#39;t see past the</p>
<p begin="01:18:24.643" end="01:18:30.143" style="s2">worst part.</p>
<p begin="01:18:26.843" end="01:18:30.143" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then let me say this once more.</p>
<p begin="01:18:30.543" end="01:18:33.943" style="s2">Don&#39;t offer to break up because you</p>
<p begin="01:18:31.743" end="01:18:35.943" style="s2">think you&#39;re doing me a favor.</p>
<p begin="01:18:33.943" end="01:18:38.243" style="s2">Okay.</p>
<p begin="01:18:35.943" end="01:18:40.443" style="s2">I understand.</p>
<p begin="01:18:38.243" end="01:18:40.443" style="s2">Eat.</p>
<p begin="01:18:45.043" end="01:18:48.843" style="s2">Scarlow still being investigated.</p>
<p begin="01:18:47.443" end="01:18:51.343" style="s2">The men working for him haven&#39;t all been</p>
<p begin="01:18:48.843" end="01:18:51.343" style="s2">found.</p>
<p begin="01:18:52.943" end="01:18:55.943" style="s2">And Claire sees me as another man who</p>
<p begin="01:18:54.243" end="01:18:57.443" style="s2">can take over Noah&#39;s life. I need her to</p>
<p begin="01:18:55.943" end="01:18:58.743" style="s2">see that he still gets to choose.</p>
<p begin="01:18:57.443" end="01:19:00.143" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She was promised a life together, then</p>
<p begin="01:18:58.743" end="01:19:01.143" style="s2">let&#39;s not surprising that promises</p>
<p begin="01:19:00.143" end="01:19:02.343" style="s2">frighten her now.</p>
<p begin="01:19:01.143" end="01:19:04.043" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If I show her what I&#39;m prepared to</p>
<p begin="01:19:02.343" end="01:19:06.243" style="s2">change,</p>
<p begin="01:19:04.043" end="01:19:09.343" style="s2">will she believe I mean it?</p>
<p begin="01:19:06.243" end="01:19:09.343" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I can&#39;t promise that.</p>
<p begin="01:19:11.143" end="01:19:14.743" style="s2">Show her how you&#39;re going to stay here</p>
<p begin="01:19:13.143" end="01:19:18.643" style="s2">and how Noah keeps his own work and his</p>
<p begin="01:19:14.743" end="01:19:18.643" style="s2">own future, not what you can buy him.</p>
<p begin="01:19:20.594" end="01:19:22.614" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:19:31.443" end="01:19:34.343" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All of this is yours?</p>
<p begin="01:19:33.143" end="01:19:35.943" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Most of it.</p>
<p begin="01:19:34.343" end="01:19:38.743" style="s2">I keep a lot packed away. I don&#39;t bring</p>
<p begin="01:19:35.943" end="01:19:38.743" style="s2">it out very often.</p>
<p begin="01:19:39.143" end="01:19:41.945" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What else are you hiding? Do</p>
<p begin="01:19:39.945" end="01:19:43.144" style="s2">&gt;&gt; you own a team I don&#39;t know about?</p>
<p begin="01:19:41.945" end="01:19:44.644" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You watch too much drama.</p>
<p begin="01:19:43.144" end="01:19:47.344" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m serious. I&#39;m starting to wonder what</p>
<p begin="01:19:44.644" end="01:19:47.344" style="s2">I don&#39;t know about you.</p>
<p begin="01:19:47.844" end="01:19:51.144" style="s2">We could have dinner with my mother.</p>
<p begin="01:19:49.545" end="01:19:52.244" style="s2">She&#39;d be happy to tell you everything.</p>
<p begin="01:19:51.144" end="01:19:53.644" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, let&#39;s get through one family</p>
<p begin="01:19:52.244" end="01:19:54.744" style="s2">conversation before we start another,</p>
<p begin="01:19:53.644" end="01:19:57.045" style="s2">okay?</p>
<p begin="01:19:54.744" end="01:19:57.045" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay.</p>
<p begin="01:19:57.144" end="01:19:59.344" style="s2">Come on.</p>
<p begin="01:20:01.445" end="01:20:04.844" style="s2">Shoes off.</p>
<p begin="01:20:02.644" end="01:20:06.945" style="s2">Get comfortable.</p>
<p begin="01:20:04.844" end="01:20:09.844" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You got me my own pair?</p>
<p begin="01:20:06.945" end="01:20:12.945" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You kept borrowing mine.</p>
<p begin="01:20:09.844" end="01:20:15.744" style="s2">It wasn&#39;t hard to work out.</p>
<p begin="01:20:12.945" end="01:20:15.744" style="s2">You noticed that, too.</p>
<p begin="01:20:17.545" end="01:20:21.545" style="s2">Where&#39;s this old goal?</p>
<p begin="01:20:19.844" end="01:20:24.344" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I have to set it up first.</p>
<p begin="01:20:21.545" end="01:20:26.945" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You need to set it up just to show me?</p>
<p begin="01:20:24.344" end="01:20:26.945" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Here we are.</p>
<p begin="01:20:27.545" end="01:20:30.445" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You kept all of this.</p>
<p begin="01:20:31.945" end="01:20:34.844" style="s2">What is all this worth?</p>
<p begin="01:20:33.344" end="01:20:36.744" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s not what matters.</p>
<p begin="01:20:34.844" end="01:20:40.045" style="s2">I care whether you like seeing it.</p>
<p begin="01:20:36.744" end="01:20:40.045" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So where is it, the old goal?</p>
<p begin="01:20:40.445" end="01:20:45.545" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Right here.</p>
<p begin="01:20:42.545" end="01:20:45.545" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is the goal you meant?</p>
<p begin="01:20:48.344" end="01:20:50.545" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah.</p>
<p begin="01:20:51.545" end="01:20:53.445" style="s2">I made it when I was a kid alone at</p>
<p begin="01:20:52.945" end="01:20:55.244" style="s2">home.</p>
<p begin="01:20:53.445" end="01:20:57.744" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s more than 20 years old. Why were</p>
<p begin="01:20:55.244" end="01:20:57.744" style="s2">you alone?</p>
<p begin="01:20:58.844" end="01:21:03.045" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad was away for work. Mom was running</p>
<p begin="01:21:00.644" end="01:21:04.445" style="s2">hotels. Most days it was just me. I made</p>
<p begin="01:21:03.045" end="01:21:05.945" style="s2">goals out of scraps and practiced on the</p>
<p begin="01:21:04.445" end="01:21:07.545" style="s2">floor. I made several, but this one</p>
<p begin="01:21:05.945" end="01:21:09.344" style="s2">stayed together, so I kept it. Whenever</p>
<p begin="01:21:07.545" end="01:21:10.445" style="s2">I felt alone, I took it out.</p>
<p begin="01:21:09.344" end="01:21:12.244" style="s2">It reminded me I could still make</p>
<p begin="01:21:10.445" end="01:21:15.144" style="s2">something of the day. It means a lot to</p>
<p begin="01:21:12.244" end="01:21:15.144" style="s2">me. I want you to have it.</p>
<p begin="01:21:15.744" end="01:21:19.344" style="s2">Do you like it?</p>
<p begin="01:21:16.945" end="01:21:19.344" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I do.</p>
<p begin="01:21:19.844" end="01:21:24.144" style="s2">You must have been so lonely.</p>
<p begin="01:21:22.244" end="01:21:25.344" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m not lonely now.</p>
<p begin="01:21:24.144" end="01:21:26.844" style="s2">I want to hear all of it, all your</p>
<p begin="01:21:25.344" end="01:21:29.144" style="s2">stories.</p>
<p begin="01:21:26.844" end="01:21:31.545" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay. No hiding.</p>
<p begin="01:21:29.144" end="01:21:31.545" style="s2">Sit back.</p>
<p begin="01:21:32.045" end="01:21:34.945" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You still haven&#39;t told me what all that</p>
<p begin="01:21:33.144" end="01:21:36.545" style="s2">stuff is worth.</p>
<p begin="01:21:34.945" end="01:21:38.244" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Taking inventory of my money?</p>
<p begin="01:21:36.545" end="01:21:40.545" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, I&#39;m curious. I &#39;m not here for</p>
<p begin="01:21:38.244" end="01:21:42.344" style="s2">expensive things.</p>
<p begin="01:21:40.545" end="01:21:43.046" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know.</p>
<p begin="01:21:42.344" end="01:21:44.546" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Careful.</p>
<p begin="01:21:43.046" end="01:21:46.745" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That looks expensive.</p>
<p begin="01:21:44.546" end="01:21:47.146" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not that expensive. If you like it, you</p>
<p begin="01:21:46.745" end="01:21:50.446" style="s2">can have it.</p>
<p begin="01:21:47.146" end="01:21:52.845" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No. I&#39;d be terrified of dropping it.</p>
<p begin="01:21:50.446" end="01:21:55.146" style="s2">I couldn&#39;t replace that.</p>
<p begin="01:21:52.845" end="01:21:57.745" style="s2">This is what I want.</p>
<p begin="01:21:55.146" end="01:22:01.046" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I wouldn&#39;t make you replace you.</p>
<p begin="01:21:57.745" end="01:22:01.046" style="s2">They&#39;re old friends. That&#39;s all.</p>
<p begin="01:22:04.845" end="01:22:11.046" style="s2">What matters most to your mother?</p>
<p begin="01:22:07.446" end="01:22:11.046" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If we want her to stop shutting us out</p>
<p begin="01:22:11.745" end="01:22:15.146" style="s2">we need to understand what she&#39;s afraid</p>
<p begin="01:22:13.146" end="01:22:17.345" style="s2">of losing, what makes her feel safe.</p>
<p begin="01:22:15.146" end="01:22:19.345" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t know. For 20 years it&#39;s felt</p>
<p begin="01:22:17.345" end="01:22:22.245" style="s2">like she&#39;s had me and a reason not to</p>
<p begin="01:22:19.345" end="01:22:22.245" style="s2">trust anyone else.</p>
<p begin="01:22:25.446" end="01:22:27.646" style="s2">What&#39;s that?</p>
<p begin="01:22:26.146" end="01:22:29.546" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My plans to stay in Grey Haven where</p>
<p begin="01:22:27.646" end="01:22:30.646" style="s2">I&#39;ll live and the work I&#39;ve turned down.</p>
<p begin="01:22:29.546" end="01:22:32.245" style="s2">She&#39;s afraid I&#39;ll disappear when</p>
<p begin="01:22:30.646" end="01:22:35.245" style="s2">something better comes along. I want her</p>
<p begin="01:22:32.245" end="01:22:37.546" style="s2">to see I&#39;m already choosing a life here.</p>
<p begin="01:22:35.245" end="01:22:39.845" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;ve thought about all of this?</p>
<p begin="01:22:37.546" end="01:22:42.946" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Years of contracts.</p>
<p begin="01:22:39.845" end="01:22:44.245" style="s2">I&#39;ve learned to look past the promises.</p>
<p begin="01:22:42.946" end="01:22:45.546" style="s2">Look here.</p>
<p begin="01:22:44.245" end="01:22:46.845" style="s2">These dates are before she found out</p>
<p begin="01:22:45.546" end="01:22:48.046" style="s2">about us.</p>
<p begin="01:22:46.845" end="01:22:51.245" style="s2">And this isn&#39;t a few extra nights at the</p>
<p begin="01:22:48.046" end="01:22:51.245" style="s2">hotel I&#39;ve arranged to stay.</p>
<p begin="01:22:53.546" end="01:22:56.046" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I see.</p>
<p begin="01:22:57.546" end="01:23:01.146" style="s2">Mom, I brought something for you.</p>
<p begin="01:23:02.446" end="01:23:05.646" style="s2">&gt;&gt; From where?</p>
<p begin="01:23:04.446" end="01:23:07.046" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Damon asked me to show you. He&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:23:05.646" end="01:23:10.345" style="s2">arranged to stay in Grey Haven. He wants</p>
<p begin="01:23:07.046" end="01:23:10.345" style="s2">you to know he isn&#39;t planning to leave.</p>
<p begin="01:23:10.946" end="01:23:14.546" style="s2">What do you think? He turned down good</p>
<p begin="01:23:12.745" end="01:23:16.046" style="s2">money to stay here.</p>
<p begin="01:23:14.546" end="01:23:17.446" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do they think putting a life on paper</p>
<p begin="01:23:16.046" end="01:23:19.345" style="s2">means they&#39;ll actually be there to live</p>
<p begin="01:23:17.446" end="01:23:21.946" style="s2">it?</p>
<p begin="01:23:19.345" end="01:23:23.345" style="s2">Your father left plans, keys, money,</p>
<p begin="01:23:21.946" end="01:23:25.745" style="s2">said everything was taken care of. Do</p>
<p begin="01:23:23.345" end="01:23:27.446" style="s2">you know what he didn&#39;t leave?</p>
<p begin="01:23:25.745" end="01:23:29.046" style="s2">Himself.</p>
<p begin="01:23:27.446" end="01:23:31.546" style="s2">I lost the life I thought we were going</p>
<p begin="01:23:29.046" end="01:23:31.546" style="s2">to have.</p>
<p begin="01:23:34.745" end="01:23:38.745" style="s2">I know what you want to say. He&#39;s making</p>
<p begin="01:23:36.946" end="01:23:42.245" style="s2">plans, giving things up, spending time</p>
<p begin="01:23:38.745" end="01:23:43.647" style="s2">on you, so he must love you.</p>
<p begin="01:23:42.245" end="01:23:45.147" style="s2">Your father promised my mother</p>
<p begin="01:23:43.647" end="01:23:47.647" style="s2">everything.</p>
<p begin="01:23:45.147" end="01:23:51.047" style="s2">Then he cheated and left us.</p>
<p begin="01:23:47.647" end="01:23:52.247" style="s2">I remember what promises sounded like.</p>
<p begin="01:23:51.047" end="01:23:53.747" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hello.</p>
<p begin="01:23:52.247" end="01:23:54.947" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Can you come by the arena? Your things</p>
<p begin="01:23:53.747" end="01:23:55.947" style="s2">are ready to collect.</p>
<p begin="01:23:54.947" end="01:23:58.047" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay.</p>
<p begin="01:23:55.947" end="01:24:00.347" style="s2">I&#39;m on my way.</p>
<p begin="01:23:58.047" end="01:24:00.347" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Go.</p>
<p begin="01:24:04.547" end="01:24:08.347" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Those two were behind me before I got</p>
<p begin="01:24:06.047" end="01:24:08.347" style="s2">here.</p>
<p begin="01:24:09.547" end="01:24:12.347" style="s2">They&#39;re following me.</p>
<p begin="01:24:16.147" end="01:24:18.647" style="s2">Damon, I&#39;m at the arena. Two men have</p>
<p begin="01:24:17.847" end="01:24:19.847" style="s2">been following me.</p>
<p begin="01:24:18.647" end="01:24:20.947" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stay where people can see you. Head for</p>
<p begin="01:24:19.847" end="01:24:21.347" style="s2">the main entrance and security. I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="01:24:20.947" end="01:24:22.747" style="s2">coming.</p>
<p begin="01:24:21.347" end="01:24:24.347" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay.</p>
<p begin="01:24:22.747" end="01:24:28.047" style="s2">I&#39;m heading to the front doors.</p>
<p begin="01:24:24.347" end="01:24:28.047" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Come on. Move.</p>
<p begin="01:24:28.147" end="01:24:31.747" style="s2">Lucky, I&#39;m almost there.</p>
<p begin="01:24:33.747" end="01:24:36.847" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you hurt?</p>
<p begin="01:24:34.647" end="01:24:36.847" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="01:24:37.247" end="01:24:40.647" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who sent you? Your boy needs to change</p>
<p begin="01:24:39.247" end="01:24:42.347" style="s2">his story about Scarlow. Keep getting in</p>
<p begin="01:24:40.647" end="01:24:45.047" style="s2">the way and you won&#39;t have a boyfriend</p>
<p begin="01:24:42.347" end="01:24:46.547" style="s2">to worry about.</p>
<p begin="01:24:45.047" end="01:24:48.347" style="s2">The evidence is already with the police.</p>
<p begin="01:24:46.547" end="01:24:49.247" style="s2">Threatening him won&#39;t erase it. Walk</p>
<p begin="01:24:48.347" end="01:24:51.747" style="s2">away.</p>
<p begin="01:24:49.247" end="01:24:53.747" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Both of us. Get Morgan. Police. Grey</p>
<p begin="01:24:51.747" end="01:24:57.247" style="s2">Haven Wolves arena, main entrance. Two</p>
<p begin="01:24:53.747" end="01:24:57.247" style="s2">men are attacking us. One has a gun.</p>
<p begin="01:25:13.847" end="01:25:16.947" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Noah.</p>
<p begin="01:25:15.047" end="01:25:19.147" style="s2">Let me see you. Are you hurt?</p>
<p begin="01:25:16.947" end="01:25:20.647" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, I&#39;m okay.</p>
<p begin="01:25:19.147" end="01:25:21.847" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank God. Where is he?</p>
<p begin="01:25:20.647" end="01:25:23.247" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Still in surgery. They said there was</p>
<p begin="01:25:21.847" end="01:25:24.747" style="s2">bleeding in his head.</p>
<p begin="01:25:23.247" end="01:25:25.847" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s serious.</p>
<p begin="01:25:24.747" end="01:25:27.747" style="s2">He didn&#39;t [laughter] even hesitate. They</p>
<p begin="01:25:25.847" end="01:25:29.547" style="s2">kept hitting him. There was blood all</p>
<p begin="01:25:27.747" end="01:25:31.847" style="s2">over his face. He still wouldn&#39;t let go.</p>
<p begin="01:25:29.547" end="01:25:32.847" style="s2">He was trying to keep them away from me.</p>
<p begin="01:25:31.847" end="01:25:34.347" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And what does that change?</p>
<p begin="01:25:32.847" end="01:25:35.947" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know you hate him, but he isn&#39;t only</p>
<p begin="01:25:34.347" end="01:25:38.647" style="s2">the man who hurt us.</p>
<p begin="01:25:35.947" end="01:25:38.647" style="s2">He saved me.</p>
<p begin="01:25:41.047" end="01:25:44.247" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;ve treated the bleeding and he&#39;s out</p>
<p begin="01:25:42.347" end="01:25:45.849" style="s2">of immediate danger. There may still be</p>
<p begin="01:25:44.247" end="01:25:48.749" style="s2">lasting effects. We&#39;ll need watch his</p>
<p begin="01:25:45.849" end="01:25:48.749" style="s2">recovery closely.</p>
<p begin="01:25:51.249" end="01:25:55.649" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Claire, I</p>
<p begin="01:25:53.149" end="01:25:57.149" style="s2">I&#39;m sorry for what I did to you</p>
<p begin="01:25:55.649" end="01:25:59.049" style="s2">and to Noah.</p>
<p begin="01:25:57.149" end="01:26:00.549" style="s2">I told myself I was building something,</p>
<p begin="01:25:59.049" end="01:26:02.149" style="s2">that I&#39;d give you a better life. I used</p>
<p begin="01:26:00.549" end="01:26:03.149" style="s2">that to excuse everything I left you to</p>
<p begin="01:26:02.149" end="01:26:05.349" style="s2">carry.</p>
<p begin="01:26:03.149" end="01:26:08.948" style="s2">I&#39;m not asking you to forgive me. I just</p>
<p begin="01:26:05.349" end="01:26:08.948" style="s2">needed to say it to you myself.</p>
<p begin="01:26:09.549" end="01:26:12.448" style="s2">I&#39;m sorry.</p>
<p begin="01:26:16.249" end="01:26:20.948" style="s2">Claire.</p>
<p begin="01:26:18.349" end="01:26:20.948" style="s2">Claire.</p>
<p begin="01:26:23.149" end="01:26:27.448" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Claire, may I speak to you?</p>
<p begin="01:26:25.849" end="01:26:28.649" style="s2">I know you don&#39;t trust me yet. I&#39;m not</p>
<p begin="01:26:27.448" end="01:26:31.049" style="s2">asking you to believe a speech. I want</p>
<p begin="01:26:28.649" end="01:26:34.049" style="s2">to show you what I&#39;ve done.</p>
<p begin="01:26:31.049" end="01:26:35.149" style="s2">I&#39;ve loved Noah for six years.</p>
<p begin="01:26:34.049" end="01:26:36.849" style="s2">There hasn&#39;t been anyone else, no</p>
<p begin="01:26:35.149" end="01:26:39.149" style="s2">boyfriends, no other relationship. It &#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:26:36.849" end="01:26:39.149" style="s2">been him.</p>
<p begin="01:26:39.649" end="01:26:42.149" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Six years?</p>
<p begin="01:26:40.749" end="01:26:43.448" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I want to spend my life with him. I</p>
<p begin="01:26:42.149" end="01:26:44.749" style="s2">won&#39;t lie to him, betray him, or make</p>
<p begin="01:26:43.448" end="01:26:45.948" style="s2">him carry the cost of loving me.</p>
<p begin="01:26:44.749" end="01:26:49.149" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How can you prove that?</p>
<p begin="01:26:45.948" end="01:26:49.149" style="s2">&gt;&gt; By making the changes myself.</p>
<p begin="01:26:49.549" end="01:26:54.249" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Claire, these are the arrangements he</p>
<p begin="01:26:50.649" end="01:26:54.249" style="s2">started before any of this happened.</p>
<p begin="01:26:54.448" end="01:26:59.249" style="s2">His place here, the work he turned down,</p>
<p begin="01:26:56.049" end="01:26:59.249" style="s2">and the coach the club to prepare.</p>
<p begin="01:26:59.749" end="01:27:04.749" style="s2">He&#39;s changing his own life. He isn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:27:01.349" end="01:27:04.749" style="s2">asking Noah to give up his.</p>
<p begin="01:27:05.448" end="01:27:07.249" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There isn&#39;t anyone else I want a life</p>
<p begin="01:27:06.849" end="01:27:08.349" style="s2">with.</p>
<p begin="01:27:07.249" end="01:27:10.149" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;ve already started planning the</p>
<p begin="01:27:08.349" end="01:27:11.948" style="s2">handover. You really mean this.</p>
<p begin="01:27:10.149" end="01:27:14.649" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;d rather change my job than ask him to</p>
<p begin="01:27:11.948" end="01:27:14.649" style="s2">stop playing.</p>
<p begin="01:27:16.249" end="01:27:20.049" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s stubborn. Once he decides something</p>
<p begin="01:27:18.349" end="01:27:21.249" style="s2">matters, he keeps showing up for it.</p>
<p begin="01:27:20.049" end="01:27:22.948" style="s2">These plans weren&#39;t made to win an</p>
<p begin="01:27:21.249" end="01:27:24.349" style="s2">argument today.</p>
<p begin="01:27:22.948" end="01:27:26.849" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know being his coach is part of what</p>
<p begin="01:27:24.349" end="01:27:26.849" style="s2">frightens you.</p>
<p begin="01:27:27.448" end="01:27:30.649" style="s2">I&#39;ve stepped down. The coaching staff</p>
<p begin="01:27:29.149" end="01:27:33.749" style="s2">have taken over.</p>
<p begin="01:27:30.649" end="01:27:35.749" style="s2">Noah keeps his place in his career.</p>
<p begin="01:27:33.749" end="01:27:37.649" style="s2">I stay because I love him, not because I</p>
<p begin="01:27:35.749" end="01:27:40.948" style="s2">get to decide whether he plays.</p>
<p begin="01:27:37.649" end="01:27:40.948" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Come for dinner on Saturday.</p>
<p begin="01:27:41.549" end="01:27:44.349" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you, Claire.</p>
<p begin="01:27:50.448" end="01:27:53.350" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re</p>
<p begin="01:27:51.350" end="01:27:55.350" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hello, Claire.</p>
<p begin="01:27:53.350" end="01:27:56.850" style="s2">These are from my family.</p>
<p begin="01:27:55.350" end="01:27:57.550" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Tell them thank you.</p>
<p begin="01:27:56.850" end="01:27:59.150" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I will.</p>
<p begin="01:27:57.550" end="01:28:00.950" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I invited you because I wanted to meet</p>
<p begin="01:27:59.150" end="01:28:03.150" style="s2">the man Noah keeps telling me is so good</p>
<p begin="01:28:00.950" end="01:28:05.350" style="s2">to him.</p>
<p begin="01:28:03.150" end="01:28:06.350" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, please. I&#39;m hungry. Can we eat?</p>
<p begin="01:28:05.350" end="01:28:07.850" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Come in.</p>
<p begin="01:28:06.350" end="01:28:11.350" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you.</p>
<p begin="01:28:07.850" end="01:28:11.350" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There are new slippers by the door.</p>
<p begin="01:28:17.650" end="01:28:21.450" style="s2">Damon, I need to ask you one thing. Can</p>
<p begin="01:28:19.850" end="01:28:23.050" style="s2">I trust you to stand by Noah for the</p>
<p begin="01:28:21.450" end="01:28:24.150" style="s2">rest of your life?</p>
<p begin="01:28:23.050" end="01:28:25.250" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="01:28:24.150" end="01:28:26.050" style="s2">And I don&#39;t mean just saying the right</p>
<p begin="01:28:25.250" end="01:28:27.750" style="s2">words. I mean</p>
<p begin="01:28:26.050" end="01:28:29.250" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If someone hurts him, whoever it is, I</p>
<p begin="01:28:27.750" end="01:28:32.050" style="s2">need you on his side.</p>
<p begin="01:28:29.250" end="01:28:32.050" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You can count on that.</p>
<p begin="01:28:32.550" end="01:28:36.350" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right. Eat before it gets cold.</p>
<p begin="01:28:38.550" end="01:28:42.050" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What do you want?</p>
<p begin="01:28:40.250" end="01:28:45.350" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You know what I want.</p>
<p begin="01:28:42.050" end="01:28:45.350" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wait. Let me take a picture.</p>
<p begin="01:28:47.650" end="01:28:49.850" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No mask tonight. Just me and the man</p>
<p begin="01:28:49.050" end="01:28:53.750" style="s2">I&#39;ve wanted for years.</p>
<p begin="01:28:49.850" end="01:28:53.750" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So the 17 on your stage outfit was mine?</p>
<p begin="01:28:54.850" end="01:28:57.350" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="01:28:55.950" end="01:28:58.250" style="s2">Every time I wore it, I was thinking of</p>
<p begin="01:28:57.350" end="01:28:59.150" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="01:28:58.250" end="01:28:59.550" style="s2">I was afraid you&#39;d think it was too</p>
<p begin="01:28:59.150" end="01:29:00.650" style="s2">much.</p>
<p begin="01:28:59.550" end="01:29:02.250" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You don&#39;t have to hide the bold part of</p>
<p begin="01:29:00.650" end="01:29:03.650" style="s2">yourself with me. I want you, not a</p>
<p begin="01:29:02.250" end="01:29:04.850" style="s2">version you think looks respectable.</p>
<p begin="01:29:03.650" end="01:29:07.050" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then don&#39;t act surprised when I stop</p>
<p begin="01:29:04.850" end="01:29:07.050" style="s2">holding</p>
<p begin="01:29:07.750" end="01:29:10.950" style="s2">&gt;&gt; In a hurry?</p>
<p begin="01:29:09.050" end="01:29:12.650" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ve wanted this view for a long time.</p>
<p begin="01:29:10.950" end="01:29:14.050" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What exactly have you been imagining?</p>
<p begin="01:29:12.650" end="01:29:16.850" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The part where I pull you close and stop</p>
<p begin="01:29:14.050" end="01:29:16.850" style="s2">pretending I&#39;m shy.</p>
<p begin="01:29:16.950" end="01:29:20.350" style="s2">Or that night at Velvet.</p>
<p begin="01:29:18.750" end="01:29:21.950" style="s2">I saw you take off your mask by the side</p>
<p begin="01:29:20.350" end="01:29:23.450" style="s2">door.</p>
<p begin="01:29:21.950" end="01:29:24.850" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You knew that night and you let me keep</p>
<p begin="01:29:23.450" end="01:29:26.050" style="s2">trying to hide it? Please let the floor</p>
<p begin="01:29:24.850" end="01:29:27.750" style="s2">swallow me.</p>
<p begin="01:29:26.050" end="01:29:29.950" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Baby, look at me.</p>
<p begin="01:29:27.750" end="01:29:31.250" style="s2">The love you want is what I want, too.</p>
<p begin="01:29:29.950" end="01:29:33.950" style="s2">The romance.</p>
<p begin="01:29:31.250" end="01:29:36.750" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stop. Please stop talking.</p>
<p begin="01:29:33.950" end="01:29:36.750" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That works better.</p>
<p begin="01:29:42.197" end="01:29:44.217" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="01:29:50.057" end="01:29:52.077" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="01:29:59.227" end="01:30:01.851" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="01:29:59.751" end="01:30:01.851" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you.</p>
</div>
</body>
</tt>
